1
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:58,200
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

2
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:50,800
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

3
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:33,960
(Chlorpromazine Hydrochloride Injection)
（盐酸氯丙嗪注射液）

4
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,080
Who is it?
谁呀？

5
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,600
Hualin Public Security Bureau.
桦林公安局的

6
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,520
Ma Desheng.
马德胜

7
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,960
We've met before, in Hualin.
咱们在桦林见过

8
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:43,600
I remember you, Captain Ma.
有印象，马队长

9
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,880
What brings you to Songhe?
怎么到松河来了？

10
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,600
I was just passing through.
这不是正好路过吗？

11
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:49,040
I'm here to ask you a few things about Shen Mo.
沈墨的事，我来跟你了解点情况

12
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,000
Come in.
请进

13
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,400
This way, please.
来，这边请

14
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,040
Have a seat.
坐这

15
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,240
A big tiger.
大老虎

16
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,840
Looks fierce.
挺凶啊

17
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,240
Borrowing the tiger's might, are we?
狐假虎威吧

18
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:23,160
How else do you catch tiger cubs without entering the tiger's den?
还不入虎穴，焉得虎子呢

19
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,600
You've got a line for everything.
一套一套的

20
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,200
Captain Ma.
马队长

21
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,360
Sorry to intrude.
打扰了啊

22
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,360
Have a seat.
你坐啊

23
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,600
Smoke?
抽烟吗？

24
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,560
I quit.
戒了

25
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,040
Shen Mo...
沈墨…

26
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:57,160
How old was she when she came to live with you?
几岁和你们一起生活的呀？

27
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,720
You've asked me before.
你问过我

28
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:04,760
Not quite nine.
九岁不到

29
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,920
Under nine.
不到九岁

30
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,280
How was your relationship?
你们关系怎么样？

31
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,840
Did you talk much, day to day?
平时交流得多吗？

32
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,560
What relationship? We're family.
啥关系？ 一家人

33
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,880
Why so tense?
怎么紧张呀？

34
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,600
Having a cop in the house feels awkward, right?
警察进家里别扭是不？

35
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,000
It's fine, just chatting.
没事，瞎聊聊

36
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,400
Why not stay for a drink at noon?
要不中午你在这喝口？

37
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:33,160
No, I'm just here for a quick chat.
没有，我就瞎聊两句

38
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,880
It's just, there's this case.
这不这案子在这呢

39
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,960
It's... it's troubling.
它也…它也愁

40
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,640
About her...
她这个…

41
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:44,560
Before she went to college in Hualin, did she ever date anyone?
去桦林上大学之前，谈过恋爱吗？

42
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,600
As far as I know,
据我了解

43
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,600
no.
没有

44
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,400
No.
没有

45
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,880
Which room was hers? Mind if I take a look?
她住哪屋？ 我能瞅瞅不？

46
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,560
Is that all right?
方便不？

47
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,440
It's fine.
方便

48
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,720
This room?
这屋啊？

49
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:07,920
This room.
这屋

50
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,400
No one lives in this room now?
这屋现在没人住啊？

51
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:19,920
No.
是

52
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:21,800
Since Momo left,
墨墨走了

53
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,920
the room's been empty.
这屋子就空了

54
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,000
Nice piano.
钢琴不错

55
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,480
It's Shen Mo's, isn't it?
这是沈墨的吧？

56
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,720
You spared no expense.
挺舍得花钱呀

57
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,440
We raised her like our own daughter.
当亲闺女养的嘛

58
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:38,920
Have some water.
喝口水吧

59
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,760
Have some water.
喝口水

60
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,600
Thanks.
谢谢

61
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:06,160
You raised Shen Mo so well.
把沈墨养得这么好

62
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,840
Weren't you afraid she'd run into bad people?
不怕她碰到坏人啊？

63
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:11,440
Captain Ma, the way you talk...
马队长，你这嗑唠的

64
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,560
Isn't that what you police are for?
不是还有你们警察吗？

65
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:20,160
(Labor Union)
（工会）

66
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:22,080
You work at the No. 2 Textile Mill, right?
我记着你在二纺厂工作是吧？

67
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:25,280
Yes, I drive for the labor union.
对，在工会开车

68
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,400
Let's talk somewhere else.
咱俩换个地唠唠

69
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,480
This money order matures on the 17th.
这张汇票的承兑日期是17号

70
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,640
Which is today.
也就是今天

71
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:05,160
The bank opens at nine.
银行九点钟上班

72
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,640
I'll take one team inside the bank.
我带一组人在银行里

73
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,720
Two more teams cover the north and south intersections.
南北、两个路口由两组人守住

74
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,080
A sum this large,
这么大一笔钱

75
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:13,000
whoever dared go once will surely go a second time.
这个人敢去第一次 就一定会再去第二次

76
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,000
Besides the bank,
除了银行

77
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:17,040
the train station, the bus station — every transit hub in and out of Hualin
火车站、汽车站 所有能出入桦林的交通枢纽

78
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,720
is already staffed in advance.
都已经提前安排好人了

79
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,200
Today, no one gets out of Hualin.
保证今天谁也跑不出桦林

80
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,440
Who let you in?
谁让你进来的？

81
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:26,600
I'm looking for Captain Ma.
我找马队

82
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,800
Master Wang.
王师傅

83
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,880
Outside.
门口

84
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:32,840
Director Zhu.
朱局

85
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,040
A moment, outside.
门口一下

86
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,600
You... go on.
你…你接着说

87
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,040
Captain Ma went to Songhe yesterday.
马队昨天去松河了

88
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,400
Did he say when he'd be back?
没说啥时候回来？

89
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,680
He should be back tonight.
今天晚上应该能回来

90
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,520
What is it? You can tell me.
啥事？ 你跟我说吧

91
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,920
Fine, later then.
行，完了再说

92
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,000
Everything okay?
没事？

93
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,200
It's fine.
没事

94
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,760
What've you got there?
拿的啥呀？

95
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,640
Groceries from the market.
菜市场买菜

96
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,640
-Really nothing?
-Nothing...
-真没事？
-没事…

97
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,360
Look at you, drenched in sweat.
你瞅你这一脑袋汗

98
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:12,080
Walked too fast. Go on back.
走急了，回吧

99
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,880
-Really nothing?
-Nothing. Go back.
-真没事？
-没事，回去吧

100
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,360
Yang'er.
阳儿

101
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:25,000
Want something to eat?
吃点不？

102
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,800
I'll fry you an egg.
妈给你煎个鸡蛋

103
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,840
Mom.
妈

104
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,920
I feel awful.
我难受

105
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,320
Where does it hurt?
哪难受啊？

106
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,520
My head aches.
头疼

107
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,880
Did you bump it yesterday?
是不是昨天磕着了呀？

108
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,680
Let me see.
我看看

109
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,000
Did you hit it somewhere?
是不磕哪了？

110
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,080
Have some water.
喝点水

111
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:27,080
Let Mom rub it for you.
妈给你按按啊

112
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:30,200
What kind of pain is it?
是怎么疼法啊？

113
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:34,120
Is it throbbing, or does it come in waves?
是一跳一跳的还是一阵一阵疼？

114
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,360
Throbbing.
跳着疼

115
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,840
I just slept badly.
就是没睡好

116
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,920
Here, eat something.
来，吃点东西啊

117
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,760
-Come on.
-I'm not hungry.
-来
-我不饿

118
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:50,080
The way you're...
你这么…

119
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:53,040
Not eating, not drinking — how could you not be hungry?
不吃不喝的，能不饿吗？

120
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:59,240
Don't cry, Mom.
妳别哭啊，妈

121
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,360
I'm fine.
我没事

122
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:06,000
Trussed up like this, how could you be fine?
谁这么五花大绑能没事？

123
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:14,440
Mom, loosen these for me a little.
妈，妳帮我松快松快吧

124
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:18,840
Okay.
好

125
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,680
Your hands...
这手

126
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,120
Yang'er.
阳儿

127
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,200
Your dad's not here.
你爸没在

128
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:47,200
Tell Mom.
你跟妈说说吧

129
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,880
What's really wrong with you?
你到底怎么的了？

130
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,720
Mom.
妈

131
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,800
I want a bowl of water-rinsed rice.
我想吃碗水捞饭

132
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:00,760
Okay, Mom will go make it.
行，妈给你做去啊

133
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:09,000
Here, Yang'er.
来，阳儿

134
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,680
Eat slowly.
你慢点吃

135
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:35,040
Mom.
妈

136
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,600
My quilt feels a bit thin.
我那被子好像有点薄

137
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,240
It gets drafty at night.
夜里有点飕得慌

138
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:44,440
Didn't I just switch you to a thick quilt the other day?
这前两天不刚给你换了厚被子吗？

139
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,200
Maybe the cotton's shifted out of the corner.
可能被角的棉花跑了

140
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:52,240
Let me check, I'll find you another one.
那我看看，再给你找一床啊

141
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:23,920
Mom.
妈

142
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:27,880
I'm sorry.
对不起

143
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,320
Yang'er... what are you doing?
阳儿…你干啥？

144
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:32,600
Yang'er, open the door.
阳儿，你开门

145
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,680
Yang'er... let Mom out.
阳儿…你让妈出去

146
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,360
Yang'er, whatever you do, don't run.
阳儿，你千万别跑

147
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,480
Whatever it is, wait until your dad's back.
你有啥事，等你爸回来再说啊

148
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,440
Yang'er.
阳儿

149
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,560
Mom.
妈

150
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:44,400
I have to go out.
我必须得出去一趟

151
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:48,080
I made this mistake; I have to fix it myself.
我自己犯的错，我得自己解决

152
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,040
Wait for me.
妳等着我

153
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,920
I'll come back, I promise.
我一定回来

154
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,880
Yang'er... don't run.
阳儿…你别跑

155
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:55,840
Yang'er, open the door.
阳儿，你开门

156
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:58,280
Wang Yang...
王阳…

157
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:01,400
Open the door, Wang Yang...
你开开门呀，王阳…

158
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:04,320
Wang Yang, don't run.
王阳，你别跑

159
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,280
Wang Yang.
王阳

160
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:20,520
Wang Yang.
王阳

161
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,720
Wang Yang, open the door.
王阳，开门呀

162
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:26,880
Wang Yang...
王阳…

163
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:30,400
Wang Yang...
王阳…

164
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:37,600
Where's Wang Yang?
王阳呢？

165
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,440
He ran. I couldn't hold him.
跑了，没看住

166
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:42,160
How could you not even keep an eye on him?
妳怎么连个人都看不住？

167
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,160
What do we do?
怎么办啊？

168
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,920
Where do we even look?
上哪找去啊？

169
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,120
Stop wailing.
别嗷嗷了

170
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,000
Let me think.
我想想

171
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,080
Hello?
喂？

172
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:15,560
Please page 9652827.
请呼9652827

173
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:20,480
Say, "Wang Xiang has important information to report.
说“王响有重要情况汇报

174
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:21,680
Please call back at once."
请速速回电”

175
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,440
Do you have children, Captain Ma?
你有孩子吗，马队长？

176
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,560
As a cop, you see too many bastards.
当警察王八蛋见得太多

177
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,720
Would you dare have any?
敢生吗？

178
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:40,720
True enough.
也是

179
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:43,320
I have a son too, named Shen Hui.
我还有个儿子，叫沉辉

180
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:46,000
Honestly, my feelings for Momo...
其实我对墨墨…

181
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:51,280
I care more for Momo than for that son.
对墨墨的感情比对这个儿子感情深

182
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:54,920
You know,
你知道

183
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:59,480
this child lost both her parents.
这孩子爹妈都没了

184
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,520
I raised her for ten years.
在我这养了十年呀

185
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:04,000
Ten years.
十年

186
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:06,880
You could say
可以这么讲

187
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,680
I gave her the very best.
我把最好的都给了她

188
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:10,079
Good food, good clothes.
好吃、好穿

189
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:13,079
I even bought her a piano.
我还给她买了钢琴

190
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:20,520
Once you bring it up,
一提这个呀

191
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,720
I can't even...
不能提…

192
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:30,080
No man in this world could ever be as good to her as I was.
这个世上没有任何一个男人 能像我对她这么好

193
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,200
No one.
没有

194
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:37,640
Good in what way?
哪种好啊？

195
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:46,920
Someone took nude photos of Shen Mo and wrote a denunciation letter.
有人给沈墨拍裸照，写举报信

196
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,960
Posted it right on the notice board at Hualin Medical.
就贴在桦医的宣传栏上

197
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:50,600
You must know about this, right?
这事你肯定知道吧？

198
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,080
Who could do such a thing?
谁能干出这样的事来呀？

199
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:57,680
Could it be someone close to her?
不会就是她身边的人吧？

200
00:17:57,760 --> 00:18:00,360
Wanting to control her, taking nude photos.
想控制她，拍裸照

201
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:03,160
Treating her like a plaything.
把她当玩物

202
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,440
And Shen Mo didn't dare resist.
沈墨又不敢反抗

203
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:11,960
A child grows up one day.
孩子总有长大的一天

204
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,240
She'd surely want to break free of that control.
肯定是想摆脱这种控制

205
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:17,000
But that person wouldn't have it.
可这个人就不干了

206
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:21,040
Wouldn't you say such a person deserves to die a thousand deaths?
你说这人是不是罪该万死？

207
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:24,800
Captain Ma, if you have something to say, say it straight.
马队长，你有什么你就直说

208
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,040
Don't beat around the bush.
别绕弯子

209
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:28,200
There's a kettle in that photo, isn't there?
这照片上不是有个水壶吗？

210
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:30,640
Doesn't it look familiar?
看着是不是挺眼熟？

211
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:33,200
I saw an identical one in your house.
我在你们家看着个一模一样的

212
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:35,560
Explain that to me.
你给我解释解释这事

213
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:37,480
This kettle?
就这水壶啊？

214
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:40,640
You're really something.
你可真招笑

215
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:44,720
At our No. 2 Textile Mill, every household has one just like it.
在我们二纺厂 家家户户都有这么一把

216
00:18:46,120 --> 00:18:47,080
What you want to ask me is
你是想问我

217
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:49,280
whether I took that photo, right?
这照片是不是我拍的吧？

218
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,560
Did you take it?
是不是你拍的？

219
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:56,240
You're a policeman.
你是警察

220
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:57,960
How can you even ask me that?
你怎么还能问我呢？

221
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,360
Let me tell you, Shen Dongliang,
我告诉你，沉栋梁

222
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,560
I'll investigate this case to the very end.
这案子我会一查到底

223
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:02,680
Not just the murderer —
不光是杀人凶手

224
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:05,240
any monstrous, evil deed, I'll pursue to the very end.
任何伤天害理的事，我都会一查到底

225
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:09,320
Good, then I'm reassured.
好，那我就放心了

226
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,680
When you've cracked it,
到时候你查明白了

227
00:19:13,760 --> 00:19:15,360
I'll send you a banner of honor.
我给你送个锦旗

228
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:16,800
Don't be in such a hurry.
别着急呀

229
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,760
Once we're in Hualin, we'll talk at leisure.
到了桦林，咱慢慢聊

230
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:19,760
Sure.
好啊

231
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,400
In Hualin,
到桦林

232
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:25,160
in Hualin, when I meet your superiors,
到桦林我跟你们领导

233
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,560
I'll ask them properly:
见了面我好好问一问

234
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:29,440
as a people's policeman,
你作为人民警察

235
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:31,160
how exactly do you serve the people?
你是怎么为人民的？

236
00:19:31,800 --> 00:19:33,720
Like this... just like this,
就这…就这么

237
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:38,000
shoving a victim's family member into a car to interrogate him without authorization.
擅自地把受害人的家属 怼到车里来讯问

238
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:39,880
I really must ask your superiors
我到底要问问你们领导

239
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:43,320
whether this befits the conduct of a people's policeman,
这符不符合一个人民警察的行为

240
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:46,560
whether it's in line with your... your regulations.
符不符合你们…你们的规定

241
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:55,840
You know what I regretted most back then?
我当时最遗憾的你知道是什么吗？

242
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:58,160
You know what I regret most of all?
我最后悔的你知道是什么吗？

243
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:01,640
What I regret most is
我最后悔的就是

244
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,600
that she didn't die by my hand.
她没死我手里

245
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,360
Look at that.
你看看

246
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,280
Back then,
那时候

247
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,000
so pure.
多干净啊

248
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:14,480
You fucking animal.
你他妈个畜生你

249
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,720
You're not even human.
不是人的玩意

250
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,360
Get out.
下来

251
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,840
Get over here.
给我过来

252
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:39,720
Pure?
干净？

253
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:43,200
Damn.
我去

254
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:45,880
Go.
去

255
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,440
Damn.
我去

256
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,320
Fuck.
操

257
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,560
Fuck.
我操

258
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,840
Fuck.
操

259
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:11,640
This is all you've fucking got?
你他妈就这么大点能耐了？

260
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:15,120
Can't crack the case, huh?
查不明白案子是吧？

261
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:19,560
So you take it out on the victim's family?
就拿受害人家属撒气呀？

262
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,440
Come on...
来…

263
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,160
Still fucking putting on an act.
他妈还装呢

264
00:21:38,200 --> 00:21:40,240
The police are beating people!
警察打人了

265
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:44,680
The police are beating people!
警察打人了

266
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:46,800
Somebody, help!
来人啊

267
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:56,600
The police are beating people!
警察打人了

268
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:04,720
Damn.
我去

269
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:20,600
Fuck.
操

270
00:22:37,360 --> 00:22:38,480
Ma Desheng.
马德胜

271
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,320
Ma Desheng.
马德胜

272
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:43,760
This case,
这案子

273
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,640
you can't solve it.
你破不了

274
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,480
Do you know what they call...
知道啥叫…

275
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:52,560
Do you know what "dead men tell no tales" means?
你知道啥叫死无对证吗？

276
00:22:55,760 --> 00:22:57,280
You fucking...
你他妈的

277
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:17,160
Come on...
来…

278
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:20,320
Come on.
来

279
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:54,800
Boss, another plate of dumplings.
老板，再来一份饺子

280
00:24:13,840 --> 00:24:15,520
Do you remember when we were kids,
妳还记不记得咱俩小时候

281
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:19,800
how at night when I was hungry I'd sneak into the kitchen for food?
晚上我饿了去厨房偷东西吃？

282
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:25,400
Dad caught me and was going to hit me,
咱爸看见了要打我

283
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:27,480
but you insisted it was you who ate it.
妳非说是妳吃的

284
00:24:27,560 --> 00:24:29,640
In the end Dad gave me a beating anyway.
结果咱爸打了我一顿

285
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:41,120
Why bring this up all of a sudden?
怎么突然说这个？

286
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:46,040
These dumplings taste just like the ones from back then.
这个饺子和小时候吃的味道一样

287
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,320
My stomach's upset.
我肚子不舒服

288
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:25,320
I'm going to the restroom; wait for me here.
我去下厕所，妳在这等我

289
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:27,480
Do you want anything else to eat?
妳还要吃什么吗？

290
00:25:29,600 --> 00:25:31,280
Cheer up.
开心点

291
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:32,960
Smile.
要笑

292
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:10,720
One moment, please.
您稍等一下

293
00:26:15,040 --> 00:26:16,040
Wire 200.
汇200

294
00:26:58,320 --> 00:26:59,720
Boss, the check.
老板，结帐

295
00:27:11,760 --> 00:27:12,760
Don't move...
别动…

296
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:13,760
Hold him down.
摁住

297
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:14,800
Cuff him...
铐上…

298
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:16,000
-Hold him down.
-Cuff him.
-摁住
-铐上

299
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:17,240
Behave.
老实点

300
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:32,640
(If I don't come back, leave with Wang Yang)
（如果我没回来，跟王阳一起走）

301
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,000
(I'll take all the blame)
（我会承担一切）

302
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:54,280
Move...
走…

303
00:28:58,320 --> 00:28:59,840
What's the matter, Master Wang?
怎么的了，王师傅？

304
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:03,360
Last time you said
你上回说

305
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:05,800
you'd repay me if I introduced you to Huang Liru.
让我介绍黄丽茹给你，完了报答我

306
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:07,480
Does that still stand?
这个事算数不？

307
00:29:08,560 --> 00:29:09,880
It stands.
算数啊

308
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:11,840
Play it right and you might end up my brother-in-law.
整不好以后你都我姐夫了

309
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:13,040
Of course it stands.
必须算数

310
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:14,600
Here's your chance.
机会来了

311
00:29:15,240 --> 00:29:16,760
Come catch someone with me tonight.
晚上跟我去抓人

312
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:18,840
Catch who?
抓谁呀？

313
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:20,000
My son.
我儿子

314
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:24,840
The boy's been led astray by a bunch of bad kids.
这小子被一帮坏孩子给带坏了

315
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:27,240
Tonight they might run off together.
晚上没准一起跑

316
00:29:28,320 --> 00:29:30,200
No, Master Wang, you don't get it.
不，王师傅，你不知道

317
00:29:30,280 --> 00:29:32,400
These half-grown kids nowadays, they hit hard.
就现在那半大小子，下手挺黑

318
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,040
If it comes to blows,
你这要咔咔弄起来

319
00:29:34,120 --> 00:29:35,240
the two of us might be no match.
咱俩未必是对手

320
00:29:35,320 --> 00:29:36,440
What are you saying?
你啥意思？

321
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:39,360
Why not give Captain Ma a heads-up?
要不你给马队长打个招呼？

322
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,720
Have him send two men along with us.
让他派两人跟着咱俩

323
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:42,320
Can't reach Captain Ma.
马队联系不上

324
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:48,280
Does my sister know about this?
那咱家我姐知道这事不？

325
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:50,760
If you're going to marry Liru,
你要娶丽茹

326
00:29:50,840 --> 00:29:52,720
not only is my wife your sister,
不光我媳妇是你姐

327
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:54,400
my son is your nephew too.
我儿子也是你外甥

328
00:29:55,080 --> 00:29:56,480
An uncle's word carries weight.
娘亲舅大

329
00:29:56,560 --> 00:29:57,640
Are you in or not?
这事管不管？

330
00:29:57,720 --> 00:29:58,920
I'm in.
我管

331
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,920
-For my own nephew, I have to be.
-Good.
-为我亲外甥，我必须管
-好

332
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,640
Tell me, how do I help?
你说吧，怎么帮？

333
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,840
-How's it going?
-Watch this — here, one for you, here.
-怎么样？
-看着，来…给你来一个，来

334
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:40,320
What's that?
啥玩意？

335
00:30:42,960 --> 00:30:43,840
Hello.
你好

336
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,880
Could you tell me which room Gong Biao lives in?
我想问一下龚彪住哪屋呀？

337
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:47,480
-Gong Biao — Biaozi?
-Yes.
-龚彪，彪子吗？
-对

338
00:30:47,560 --> 00:30:49,280
-The one from the plant office?
-Yes.
-厂办那个？
-对

339
00:30:49,360 --> 00:30:50,520
Turn left, room two-two-two.
左拐，三个二

340
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:51,840
Okay, thanks.
好，谢谢啊

341
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:57,720
Haven't we met somewhere?
咱俩是不是在哪见过？

342
00:30:57,800 --> 00:30:58,920
Have we?
见过吗？

343
00:30:59,000 --> 00:30:59,960
I don't remember.
我怎么没印象啊？

344
00:31:00,040 --> 00:31:01,120
Aren't you a nurse at the plant hospital?
妳是不是厂医院的护士？

345
00:31:01,200 --> 00:31:03,000
You gave me a shot once — it didn't hurt at all.
妳给我打过针，妳打的一点都不疼

346
00:31:03,080 --> 00:31:04,120
Really?
是吗？

347
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:17,880
What's with your attitude?
你什么态度呢？

348
00:31:24,840 --> 00:31:26,000
What's with the attitude?
什么态度呢？

349
00:31:27,080 --> 00:31:28,280
What's with the attitude?
什么态度呢？

350
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:57,760
Hear me? Don't you point fingers at me.
听见没？ 别给我指指点点的啊

351
00:32:04,480 --> 00:32:05,440
Biaozi.
彪子

352
00:32:06,320 --> 00:32:07,960
Hey, stop knocking.
不是，别敲了

353
00:32:08,040 --> 00:32:09,120
Didn't I say no games today?
我不说今天不玩了吗？

354
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:10,800
Someone's here for you, hurry.
有人找你，快点

355
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,040
Who is it?
谁呀？

356
00:32:15,600 --> 00:32:17,680
Liru, what brings you here?
丽茹，妳怎么来了？

357
00:32:17,760 --> 00:32:18,720
Heading out?
要出去呀？

358
00:32:21,560 --> 00:32:22,440
Is this a good time?
方便吗？

359
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:24,520
If it's not, I'll come back later.
要是不方便的话，我就先回去了

360
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:25,480
It's fine...
方便…

361
00:32:25,560 --> 00:32:27,040
Come... come in.
妳进…进屋吧

362
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:31,920
What are you coming in for?
你进来干啥呀？

363
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,360
We know each other, just gonna chat.
俺俩认识，唠唠嗑吧

364
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:35,120
Chat about what? Get lost...
唠啥唠呀？ 走吧…

365
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,880
You people are really warm.
你们这人可真热情

366
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,000
Warm, my foot.
热情啥？

367
00:32:40,080 --> 00:32:41,240
Young workers.
青工

368
00:32:41,320 --> 00:32:43,520
Didn't even finish middle school, no manners.
国中都没毕业呢，没啥素质

369
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:45,400
Have a seat, Liru.
妳坐呀，丽茹

370
00:32:49,720 --> 00:32:51,040
I keep telling them,
总跟他们强调

371
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:53,480
I say, mind the housekeeping...
我说注意内务…

372
00:32:53,560 --> 00:32:55,520
these few punks keep coming to wreck my place.
就这几个小子总跑我这搞破坏

373
00:32:55,600 --> 00:32:56,520
Sit.
坐

374
00:33:01,520 --> 00:33:02,560
All clean.
干净了

375
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:28,000
Let me pour... pour you some water.
我给妳倒…倒杯水喝

376
00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:29,080
Okay.
好

377
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:32,760
It's clean.
干净的

378
00:33:41,800 --> 00:33:42,720
Thanks.
谢谢

379
00:33:43,800 --> 00:33:45,320
-Too hot? I'll add some cold water.
-It's fine...
-是不烫呀？ 我给妳加点凉水
-没事…

380
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,720
I brought a handkerchief.
我有带手绢

381
00:33:57,160 --> 00:33:58,480
Did you come to see me about something?
妳找我有事啊？

382
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:02,960
It's nothing really.
其实也没啥事

383
00:34:03,840 --> 00:34:05,440
It's just, these past few days,
就是我这几天嘛

384
00:34:06,520 --> 00:34:07,840
I keep having dreams.
老爱作梦

385
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,320
Dreams about what?
作啥梦啊？

386
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:16,120
I forget where I read this line,
我忘了我在哪看到那么一句话

387
00:34:16,600 --> 00:34:17,920
but it was quite philosophical.
说得挺有哲理的

388
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:19,880
Roughly it means...
大概意思就是…

389
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:21,880
the person who appears in your dream,
梦里出现的人

390
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:24,239
the moment you wake, you should go see them.
你醒过来马上就要去见他

391
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:26,280
Life is that simple.
生活就是这么简单

392
00:34:28,199 --> 00:34:29,320
"The Lovers on the Bridge."
《新桥恋人》

393
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,520
A French film.
法国片

394
00:34:31,040 --> 00:34:32,159
You know so much.
你懂的可真多

395
00:34:35,440 --> 00:34:36,280
Oh, right.
对了

396
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:39,920
That book about dreams you mentioned last time,
上回你说那本跟作梦有关的书

397
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:41,239
could I borrow it?
能借我看看吗？

398
00:34:43,239 --> 00:34:44,159
"The Interpretation of Dreams."
《梦的解析》

399
00:34:44,239 --> 00:34:45,960
By Freud, of Austria.
奥地利，佛洛伊德作

400
00:34:46,600 --> 00:34:47,880
If you want it, I'll find it for you.
妳要，我找给妳

401
00:34:49,239 --> 00:34:50,679
If there's one thing I have, it's books.
我这就是书多

402
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,400
-Is it hard to find?
-It's fine.
-好找吗？
-没事

403
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:02,040
If it's too much trouble, never mind.
要是太费劲就算了

404
00:35:02,120 --> 00:35:02,960
It's fine...
没事…

405
00:35:03,040 --> 00:35:05,240
I even flipped through a couple pages before bed last night.
我昨晚睡前我还…我还翻两页呢

406
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:13,520
My books are such a jumble.
我这书太杂了

407
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:21,920
You okay?
没事吧？

408
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:23,320
I'm fine...
没事…

409
00:35:24,560 --> 00:35:25,560
Did you hurt yourself?
碰哪了？

410
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:29,040
Here... come on, let me help you up, come.
来…你过来，扶你走，来

411
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:31,000
What's wrong?
怎么了？

412
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:32,160
Something's in my eye.
好像迷眼了

413
00:35:33,120 --> 00:35:34,120
Sit still...
坐好…

414
00:35:35,160 --> 00:35:36,120
Let me look.
我看看

415
00:35:37,120 --> 00:35:38,240
Which eye?
哪只眼睛啊？

416
00:35:38,320 --> 00:35:39,360
This one.
这个

417
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,320
Any better?
好点没？

418
00:35:49,680 --> 00:35:51,520
No, blow on it again.
没好，妳再吹一吹

419
00:35:57,560 --> 00:35:58,680
Now?
这回呢？

420
00:36:03,720 --> 00:36:04,960
What is it?
怎么的了？

421
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:07,560
You smell so nice.
妳身上味真好闻

422
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:10,440
Smell like what?
啥味啊？

423
00:36:11,240 --> 00:36:12,640
Like disinfectant.
消毒水味

424
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:48,520
What the heck?
什么玩意呢？

425
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:10,240
Hello, could you find Gong Biao for me?
你好，你帮我找一下龚彪

426
00:37:10,880 --> 00:37:12,800
Room two-two-two, from the plant office.
三个二，厂办的

427
00:37:23,320 --> 00:37:24,240
There you are.
在这呢

428
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,640
No wonder I couldn't find you.
我说怎么找不着呢

429
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,600
Biaozi.
彪子

430
00:37:27,680 --> 00:37:28,880
You love studying too much.
你太爱学习了

431
00:37:30,120 --> 00:37:31,080
It's a habit.
习惯了

432
00:37:31,160 --> 00:37:32,480
Arming yourself with knowledge.
用知识武装自己

433
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:37,640
Wait, we haven't even made things official yet.
不是，咱俩还没确定关系

434
00:37:37,720 --> 00:37:38,800
Isn't this improper?
这样不合适吧？

435
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:39,840
Let me ask you,
我问你

436
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:41,560
do you love me?
你爱我吗？

437
00:37:41,640 --> 00:37:42,600
I do.
我爱

438
00:37:42,680 --> 00:37:43,760
If you love me, it's proper.
爱我就合适

439
00:37:48,240 --> 00:37:50,840
Biaozi, there's a call for you at the front desk.
彪子，传达室有你电话来

440
00:37:55,680 --> 00:37:57,040
Tell them I'm not here.
你说我不在

441
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:01,760
He didn't say where he went?
他没说上哪去啊？

442
00:38:03,200 --> 00:38:05,160
Didn't leave any message before he left?
临走也没留个话啥的？

443
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:08,560
Okay, thanks.
好，谢谢

444
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,000
Unreliable.
不着调

445
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:47,360
Stop.
站住

446
00:39:48,960 --> 00:39:49,960
Stop.
站住

447
00:39:51,280 --> 00:39:52,400
Don't move.
别动啊

448
00:39:54,560 --> 00:39:56,200
I've got a weapon for self-defense here.
我手里可带着防身工具呢

449
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,560
Where's Wang Yang?
王阳呢？

450
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:03,600
I know you're in this together.
我知道你们是一伙的

451
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:08,560
The police are coming any minute.
警察马上就来了

452
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,640
When the police get here,
等警察来了

453
00:40:14,120 --> 00:40:15,560
your attitude will change.
就不是这个态度了

454
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:29,760
Turn around.
转过来

455
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:33,320
Tie yourself up.
把自己捆上

456
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:40,320
Stop.
站住

457
00:41:21,360 --> 00:41:22,800
Can you please...
你们能不能…

458
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:25,240
let Wang Yang go?
放过王阳？

459
00:41:27,680 --> 00:41:29,120
What do you want?
你们想要啥？

460
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:31,960
As long as you let Wang Yang go,
只要放过王阳

461
00:41:32,040 --> 00:41:34,680
I... I'll agree to anything.
我…我什么都能答应

462
00:41:37,840 --> 00:41:39,000
Don't worry.
你放心

463
00:41:40,840 --> 00:41:42,080
I'll keep my mouth shut.
我嘴肯定严

464
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:45,440
As long as you let Wang Yang...
只要把王阳…

465
00:41:46,360 --> 00:41:48,840
go, I... I won't say a word.
放了，我…我什么都不会说

466
00:41:52,000 --> 00:41:53,200
I'm begging you.
我求你了

467
00:41:55,160 --> 00:41:57,400
He's our only precious son.
我们就这么一个宝贝儿子

468
00:42:02,280 --> 00:42:04,360
His mother's worried sick at home.
他妈在家都急死了

469
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:06,600
His mother has a heart condition.
他妈有心脏病

470
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:08,760
She can't take the shock.
受不了刺激

471
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:10,920
Besides, I promised her
另外，我答应她

472
00:42:11,000 --> 00:42:12,840
I'd bring Wang Yang home today.
今天带王阳回去

473
00:42:14,680 --> 00:42:15,840
I'm begging you.
我求你了

474
00:42:40,200 --> 00:42:41,360
I'm sorry.
对不起

475
00:42:45,960 --> 00:42:47,800
Wang Yang is all I have.
我只有王阳了

476
00:42:55,480 --> 00:42:56,920
I'm sorry.
对不起

477
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:00,120
I'm sorry.
对不起

478
00:43:50,560 --> 00:43:51,800
It's okay.
没事啊

479
00:43:51,880 --> 00:43:53,240
Where have you been all these days?
你们这些天去哪了？

480
00:43:53,320 --> 00:43:54,920
I thought something had happened to you.
我以为妳出事了呢

481
00:43:57,440 --> 00:43:59,040
Why are you alone?
怎么就妳自己呀？

482
00:43:59,120 --> 00:44:00,040
Where's Weijun?
军儿呢？

483
00:44:04,920 --> 00:44:06,920
He got caught.
他被抓了

484
00:44:15,120 --> 00:44:16,640
Come back with me.
妳跟我回去吧

485
00:44:20,880 --> 00:44:22,080
What did you say?
你说什么？

486
00:44:24,160 --> 00:44:25,400
I've made up my mind.
我想好了

487
00:44:26,320 --> 00:44:27,600
Let's go back.
咱们回去吧

488
00:44:28,480 --> 00:44:29,440
I'll turn myself in.
我去自首

489
00:44:29,920 --> 00:44:31,120
Why?
为什么？

490
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:34,760
Didn't we agree to leave together?
咱们不是说好一起走的吗？

491
00:44:34,840 --> 00:44:37,280
You can't spend your whole life a fugitive.
妳不能一辈子当逃犯呀

492
00:44:37,920 --> 00:44:40,040
If you go back now, you still have a chance.
现在回去妳还有机会

493
00:44:43,960 --> 00:44:45,840
It's too late, Wang Yang.
来不及了，王阳

494
00:44:46,840 --> 00:44:48,600
I can't go back.
我回不去了

495
00:44:48,680 --> 00:44:49,760
It's not too late.
来得及

496
00:44:50,240 --> 00:44:52,360
We'll say the Lu Wenzhong thing was all me.
就说卢文仲的事都是我干的

497
00:44:54,440 --> 00:44:55,920
I killed him.
人是我杀的

498
00:44:56,560 --> 00:44:58,480
I disposed of the body too.
尸体也是我处理的

499
00:44:58,560 --> 00:44:59,720
It has nothing to do with you.
跟妳没关系

500
00:45:01,440 --> 00:45:03,240
You can still go on with school.
妳还能继续上学

501
00:45:03,920 --> 00:45:05,360
Still play piano.
还能弹钢琴

502
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:06,800
Still become a doctor.
还能当医生

503
00:45:10,240 --> 00:45:12,200
If I somehow make it out alive,
要是我还能活着的话

504
00:45:14,120 --> 00:45:15,640
wait for me.
妳就等着我

505
00:45:21,600 --> 00:45:23,120
I killed Yin Hong.
我杀了殷红

506
00:45:29,240 --> 00:45:31,400
The "me" they think they know
他们以为的我

507
00:45:32,640 --> 00:45:33,880
is Yin Hong.
是殷红

508
00:45:39,080 --> 00:45:40,880
I killed Yin Hong.
殷红是我杀的

509
00:45:49,560 --> 00:45:51,600
Wang Yang, you're all I have.
王阳，我只有你了

510
00:45:55,840 --> 00:45:57,600
Didn't we agree
我们不是说好

511
00:45:59,360 --> 00:46:01,600
to find a new place together,
一起找一个新的地方

512
00:46:03,120 --> 00:46:04,920
and live all over again?
重新活一次吗？

513
00:46:07,920 --> 00:46:09,600
Wang Yang, you're all I have.
王阳，我只有你了

514
00:46:09,680 --> 00:46:11,360
Come away with me.
你跟我一起走吧

515
00:46:48,960 --> 00:46:50,240
I understand now.
我明白了

516
00:46:54,320 --> 00:46:56,480
You and I aren't the same after all.
你和我还是不一样

517
00:46:59,360 --> 00:47:00,920
You have your home.
你有你的家

518
00:47:03,120 --> 00:47:04,640
You have your parents.
你有你爸妈

519
00:47:07,720 --> 00:47:09,480
I have nothing left.
我什么都没有了

520
00:48:19,080 --> 00:48:19,920
Master Wang.
王师傅

521
00:48:23,720 --> 00:48:24,920
Sorry about that, Master Wang.
对不住啊，王师傅

522
00:48:25,000 --> 00:48:26,920
Something came up last minute and held me up.
我临时有点事，绊住脚了

523
00:48:27,000 --> 00:48:27,960
Your wife said you weren't home.
嫂子说你不在家

524
00:48:28,040 --> 00:48:29,600
So I came out to meet you.
我想着出来迎迎你

525
00:48:30,160 --> 00:48:31,080
Want me to take over your shift?
要倒班不？

526
00:48:31,160 --> 00:48:32,560
I'll... I'll keep watch a while.
我…我盯一会去

527
00:48:37,560 --> 00:48:39,160
How'd you get so filthy?
你怎么整得脏兮兮的？

528
00:48:40,040 --> 00:48:41,240
What happened?
怎么整的？

529
00:48:42,440 --> 00:48:43,440
It's nothing.
没事

530
00:48:44,520 --> 00:48:45,840
Got myself caught on something.
自己卡的

531
00:48:50,720 --> 00:48:51,800
Biaozi.
彪子

532
00:48:53,120 --> 00:48:54,160
I need a favor.
求你个事

533
00:48:54,640 --> 00:48:56,800
Between us, no need to ask.
咱俩之间啥求不求的？

534
00:48:56,880 --> 00:48:58,080
What is it?
啥事啊？

535
00:48:58,960 --> 00:49:00,920
It's about this business with our Wang Yang.
就是我们家王阳那事

536
00:49:02,400 --> 00:49:04,240
Don't tell anyone, all right?
和谁都别说，好不好？

537
00:49:04,320 --> 00:49:06,640
Don't worry, my lips are sealed.
你放心，我嘴肯定严实

538
00:49:06,720 --> 00:49:07,640
Where's Wang Yang?
王阳呢？

539
00:49:09,920 --> 00:49:11,640
Don't ask. Go on home.
别问了，回去吧

540
00:49:45,600 --> 00:49:46,680
Where's Yang'er?
阳儿呢？

541
00:49:49,400 --> 00:49:50,480
Where's my boy?
孩子呢？

542
00:49:52,600 --> 00:49:53,880
No, say something.
不，你说话呀

543
00:49:53,960 --> 00:49:55,440
Where did the boy go?
孩子哪去了？

544
00:50:01,160 --> 00:50:02,320
Yang'er ran off.
阳儿跑了

545
00:50:07,200 --> 00:50:08,360
Did you run into him?
你碰上他了？

546
00:50:10,080 --> 00:50:11,560
I didn't run into Yang'er.
我没碰着阳儿

547
00:50:13,320 --> 00:50:15,520
The one I ran into was probably his accomplice.
我碰见的可能是他的同伙

548
00:50:15,600 --> 00:50:17,720
No, how... how could you let him get away?
不是，怎么…怎么能让他跑了呢？

549
00:50:17,800 --> 00:50:18,880
You said you'd surely bring him...
你不说你肯定能把他…

550
00:50:18,960 --> 00:50:21,440
Stop wailing at me, my head hurts.
妳别给我嗷嗷了，我脑袋疼

551
00:50:26,480 --> 00:50:28,400
No, he can't have run.
不是，他不能跑

552
00:50:28,480 --> 00:50:30,720
He told me to wait for him at home.
他跟我说他让我在家等他

553
00:50:33,600 --> 00:50:34,520
Oh God.
妈呀

554
00:50:38,600 --> 00:50:40,440
Where could that boy have gone?
这孩子能跑哪去呀？

555
00:50:50,000 --> 00:50:51,240
Where'd he run to?
他跑哪？

556
00:50:53,240 --> 00:50:54,160
Here.
来

557
00:50:54,680 --> 00:50:55,600
Here... take your medicine.
来…吃药

558
00:50:56,720 --> 00:50:57,800
Take your medicine.
吃药

559
00:50:57,880 --> 00:50:59,640
Take it... here.
吃药…来

560
00:51:03,760 --> 00:51:05,120
Don't overthink it.
妳别多想啊

561
00:51:06,520 --> 00:51:07,520
Yang'er's surely fine.
阳儿肯定没事

562
00:51:08,320 --> 00:51:10,720
No, I'm going out to look for him again.
不行，我一会我出去再找他

563
00:51:10,800 --> 00:51:11,960
Take your medicine.
把药吃了

564
00:51:19,240 --> 00:51:20,480
Promise me.
你答应我

565
00:51:22,280 --> 00:51:24,400
Bring my son back to me.
你把儿子给我领回来

566
00:51:27,000 --> 00:51:28,440
Don't worry.
妳放心

567
00:51:29,040 --> 00:51:30,840
Our son's sharp.
咱儿子精明

568
00:51:31,400 --> 00:51:32,840
Wherever he ends up, once he's settled,
他走到哪，落脚之后

569
00:51:32,920 --> 00:51:34,520
he'll surely contact us.
肯定会联系我们

570
00:51:35,000 --> 00:51:37,160
Then we'll go bring him home together.
到时候我们一起把他接回来

571
00:51:37,240 --> 00:51:38,960
Here, take your medicine.
来，把药吃了

572
00:52:01,560 --> 00:52:03,600
Lie down a while, rest and calm down.
妳得躺会，躺会静一静

573
00:52:10,880 --> 00:52:12,000
What are you doing?
妳干啥呀？

574
00:52:13,040 --> 00:52:14,880
I'm reheating the food.
我把菜热热

575
00:52:14,960 --> 00:52:17,040
When the boy comes back, he'll be eating cold food.
一会孩子回来，吃凉饭了

576
00:52:34,440 --> 00:52:35,480
(Hualin Steel)
（桦林钢铁）

577
00:52:35,560 --> 00:52:38,320
(Hualin Steel No. 1 Main Plant Workers' Congress)
（桦林钢铁第一总厂职工代表大会）

578
00:52:53,320 --> 00:52:55,160
Why polish it so bright?
擦那么亮干啥呀？

579
00:52:55,240 --> 00:52:56,800
The trains don't even run anymore.
火车也不跑了

580
00:52:58,280 --> 00:53:00,200
People are at fault, not the engine.
人有错，它没错

581
00:53:00,960 --> 00:53:02,080
When I see it all grimy,
我看它脏兮兮的

582
00:53:02,160 --> 00:53:03,400
it pains my heart.
我心里难受

583
00:53:05,280 --> 00:53:06,840
Quanli's not coming either.
这全力也不来了

584
00:53:07,320 --> 00:53:09,480
Hauling loads for someone, he crushed his leg.
帮人拉活，把腿给砸坏了

585
00:53:10,520 --> 00:53:12,040
All for his wife and kids.
那都是为了老婆、孩子

586
00:53:13,520 --> 00:53:15,200
This time when they announce the layoff list,
这回宣布下岗名单

587
00:53:15,280 --> 00:53:16,840
I'll be first on it in the locomotive depot.
机务段我排头一个

588
00:53:16,920 --> 00:53:18,160
It won't be you.
轮不上你

589
00:53:19,240 --> 00:53:21,240
I'll definitely be ahead of you.
我肯定排在你前头

590
00:53:24,960 --> 00:53:26,520
Let's go, Master Wang.
走吧，王师傅

591
00:53:26,600 --> 00:53:28,080
The music's already playing.
歌都放起来了

592
00:53:28,800 --> 00:53:29,920
You go ahead.
你先过去

593
00:53:30,480 --> 00:53:32,000
I'll come once I've finished polishing.
我擦完了就过去

594
00:53:33,160 --> 00:53:34,560
Not going to hear the list?
不听名单了？

595
00:53:36,280 --> 00:53:37,880
It was decided long ago.
早就定好的事了

596
00:53:38,480 --> 00:53:40,160
What difference does hearing it make?
听不听有啥两样的？

597
00:53:43,080 --> 00:53:44,520
I'll go listen.
我听听吧

598
00:54:05,480 --> 00:54:06,520
Biaozi.
彪子

599
00:54:07,880 --> 00:54:09,120
Don't go shouting.
你别瞎喊

600
00:54:09,840 --> 00:54:10,960
What've you got in your hand?
手里拿的啥呀？

601
00:54:11,600 --> 00:54:12,440
The layoff list?
下岗名单啊？

602
00:54:12,520 --> 00:54:13,400
Let me have a peek.
我瞅一眼

603
00:54:13,480 --> 00:54:15,440
No, can I just let you peek at a confidential document?
不，机密文件能随便让你们瞅吗？

604
00:54:16,160 --> 00:54:18,200
From now on, stop yelling "Biaozi, Biaozi" in public.
以后在外面别老喊彪子彪子啊

605
00:54:18,280 --> 00:54:19,760
-Show some respect.
-Fine.
-注意点分寸
-行

606
00:54:19,840 --> 00:54:21,160
After the meeting, he's getting promoted.
一会开会人提拔了

607
00:54:21,240 --> 00:54:22,360
Sure, Director Biao.
行，彪主任

608
00:54:22,440 --> 00:54:23,800
Don't talk nonsense.
别瞎说

609
00:54:24,360 --> 00:54:27,120
Until the official red-header order comes down, it's not official, got it?
红头文件没下来都不算数，知道不？

610
00:54:28,000 --> 00:54:30,400
In a few days I'll set something up at Canteen No. 2.
过几天我在二食堂安排

611
00:54:30,480 --> 00:54:31,600
Everyone come, all right?
到时候大伙都到啊

612
00:54:31,680 --> 00:54:32,800
Set up what?
安排啥呀？

613
00:54:33,400 --> 00:54:34,680
A wedding banquet.
喜酒吧

614
00:54:34,760 --> 00:54:36,280
Liru and I are about to register our marriage.
我跟丽茹马上要领证了

615
00:54:36,360 --> 00:54:37,400
Huang Liru?
黄丽茹？

616
00:54:37,480 --> 00:54:38,560
The one from the plant hospital?
厂医院那个？

617
00:54:39,160 --> 00:54:40,480
Who else would it be?
那还能有谁呀？

618
00:54:40,560 --> 00:54:42,200
Would I settle for just anyone?
一般人我能看上吗？

619
00:54:42,280 --> 00:54:44,440
That scarf of yours is pretty snazzy.
你这围脖整得挺带劲啊

620
00:54:44,920 --> 00:54:45,760
Liru bought it.
丽茹买的

621
00:54:45,840 --> 00:54:47,360
It's part of a set, see?
这不一套的吗？

622
00:54:47,440 --> 00:54:48,840
Nice color.
色挺正

623
00:54:48,920 --> 00:54:50,440
Little Gong, what are you chatting about over there?
小龚，唠啥呢在那？

624
00:54:50,520 --> 00:54:51,520
Get moving.
赶紧的

625
00:54:54,480 --> 00:54:55,880
Biaozi's taking the fall.
彪子接锅了

626
00:54:55,960 --> 00:54:56,880
What do you mean?
啥意思？

627
00:54:56,960 --> 00:54:57,920
Let me tell you,
我告诉你啊

628
00:54:58,000 --> 00:55:01,960
Song Yukun's wife went to the plant hospital this morning and made a scene.
宋玉坤他媳妇早上去厂医院闹去了

629
00:55:02,040 --> 00:55:05,000
Said Huang Liru seduced the factory director.
说黄丽茹勾引厂长

630
00:55:06,280 --> 00:55:07,280
-For real?
-For real.
-真的假的？
-真的

631
00:55:07,360 --> 00:55:09,320
The two of them have been at it a long time.
他俩都好老长时间了

632
00:55:09,400 --> 00:55:10,400
Listen, you two,
我告诉你俩啊

633
00:55:10,480 --> 00:55:12,600
keep it to yourselves, don't spread it around.
自己知道得了，别出去说去

634
00:55:12,680 --> 00:55:13,760
Okay... got it.
行…知道了

635
00:55:13,840 --> 00:55:14,720
Give me a light.
火给我

636
00:55:41,280 --> 00:55:43,160
What are you doing over here? Done pouring the water?
你跑这来干啥呢？ 水倒完了吗？

637
00:55:43,240 --> 00:55:44,080
Done.
倒完了

638
00:55:44,160 --> 00:55:45,800
I figured I'd ask if there's anything else to do.
我寻思问问还有没有别的活

639
00:55:46,360 --> 00:55:48,960
Um... arrange the flowers on the stage nicely,
那啥…你把台上那花再好好摆摆

640
00:55:49,040 --> 00:55:50,880
and once that's done, go over the meeting agenda with them again.
摆完之后把会议流程 再跟他们对一下

641
00:55:50,960 --> 00:55:51,960
-Go on.
-Okay.
-去吧
-行

642
00:56:13,720 --> 00:56:14,960
There's nothing more to say.
没啥好说的

643
00:56:16,080 --> 00:56:17,600
I've thought it all through.
我都想明白了

644
00:56:18,720 --> 00:56:20,560
I definitely can't keep this child.
这孩子我肯定不能要

645
00:56:20,640 --> 00:56:21,960
Let's not be rash, okay?
咱别冲动好不好？

646
00:56:22,040 --> 00:56:23,360
Just give me a little time.
妳稍微给我点时间

647
00:56:23,440 --> 00:56:24,760
I'm not being rash.
我没冲动

648
00:56:24,840 --> 00:56:25,840
I'm getting married.
我要结婚了

649
00:56:25,920 --> 00:56:27,320
Let's end it here.
咱们到此为止吧

650
00:56:27,800 --> 00:56:28,720
Let's not see each other anymore.
以后别见面了

651
00:56:28,800 --> 00:56:29,680
Liru.
丽茹

652
00:56:30,440 --> 00:56:31,320
Liru.
丽茹

653
00:56:53,280 --> 00:56:54,960
(Hualin Steel No. 1 Main Plant Workers' Congress)
（桦林钢铁第一总厂职工代表大会）

654
00:56:55,040 --> 00:56:56,760
Workers of Hualin Steel,
桦钢的职工们

655
00:56:56,840 --> 00:56:59,160
today fate brings us together here.
今天我们有缘相聚在这

656
00:56:59,240 --> 00:57:01,680
My feelings are very complicated.
我这个心里很复杂

657
00:57:02,160 --> 00:57:04,400
I have deep feelings for Hualin Steel.
我对桦钢有很深的感情

658
00:57:04,480 --> 00:57:08,040
I believe everyone here feels the same about Hualin Steel as I do.
我相信在座的各位 对桦钢的情感跟我是一样的

659
00:57:08,120 --> 00:57:10,280
Some comrades feel even more deeply than I.
甚至有些同志比我还要深

660
00:57:11,840 --> 00:57:15,040
But today there's a fact I must share with you all.
但今天有个事实我不得不跟大伙说

661
00:57:15,520 --> 00:57:18,840
Hualin Steel's situation right now is not optimistic.
就是桦钢现在的处境不乐观

662
00:57:18,920 --> 00:57:20,640
-The burden is very heavy.
-Master Wang.
-负担非常重
-王师傅

663
00:57:20,720 --> 00:57:22,600
This carriage that is Hualin Steel —
桦钢这驾马车

664
00:57:23,960 --> 00:57:24,840
it can't be pulled any longer.
拉不动了

665
00:57:25,440 --> 00:57:26,560
Where's he up to?
讲到哪了？

666
00:57:26,640 --> 00:57:28,000
Just started.
刚开始

667
00:57:28,080 --> 00:57:29,600
Rambling on about a load of useless stuff.
净扯一堆没有用的

668
00:57:30,080 --> 00:57:31,720
We came just to hear the list, didn't we?
来不就是听名单的吗？

669
00:57:33,400 --> 00:57:36,280
Don't they have to sound the opening gong before the opera?
唱戏之前不得有个开场锣吗？

670
00:57:36,800 --> 00:57:38,760
We know their routine all too well.
他们这套路子咱太熟了

671
00:57:39,240 --> 00:57:42,000
Now is the time for us to give back to Hualin Steel.
现在就是我们回馈桦钢的时候

672
00:57:49,440 --> 00:57:52,360
Some comrades have grievances, and I understand that.
有一些同志有怨言，我可以理解

673
00:57:53,520 --> 00:57:55,760
But once grievances turn into rumors,
但怨言一旦变成谣言

674
00:57:55,840 --> 00:57:57,280
that's fatal.
那是致命的

675
00:58:01,680 --> 00:58:02,680
What are you standing there for?
愣着干啥呀？

676
00:58:02,760 --> 00:58:03,680
Go pour the water.
倒水去

677
00:58:05,480 --> 00:58:07,320
What else I want to say is, some workers —
还有我要说的就是一些职工

678
00:58:07,880 --> 00:58:08,880
for instance, dual-worker households —
比如说双职工

679
00:58:08,960 --> 00:58:10,280
who are genuinely in difficulty,
确实遇到困难的

680
00:58:10,360 --> 00:58:12,120
we must help them in good time.
我们要及时地予以帮助

681
00:58:12,200 --> 00:58:15,240
We must also tackle the issue of raising output and efficiency.
还有就是要解决增产、增效这个问题

682
00:58:15,320 --> 00:58:17,560
That's the focus of our work going forward.
这是我们接下来工作的重点

683
00:58:17,640 --> 00:58:20,120
Win or lose, live life boldly.
看成败，人生豪迈

684
00:58:20,200 --> 00:58:22,880
We must have confidence and resolve.
我们必须要有信心，要有决心

685
00:58:22,960 --> 00:58:25,160
There's no hurdle we can't clear.
没有什么坎是我们过不去的

686
00:58:25,840 --> 00:58:26,960
Enough.
够了

687
00:58:27,640 --> 00:58:29,000
What are you doing?
你干啥呢？

688
00:58:32,600 --> 00:58:34,280
Why'd the mic cut out?
怎么还哑火了呢？

689
00:58:35,080 --> 00:58:36,680
What exactly is between you and Liru?
你到底跟丽茹啥关系？

690
00:58:38,240 --> 00:58:39,600
I'm giving a report. Get down.
我在作报告，下去

691
00:58:39,680 --> 00:58:40,640
You fucking set me up.
你他妈坑我

692
00:58:41,320 --> 00:58:43,080
Gong Biao, don't push your luck. Get down.
龚彪，别给脸不要，下去

693
00:58:43,160 --> 00:58:44,760
Gong Biao, get down.
龚彪，你下来

694
00:58:44,840 --> 00:58:45,720
Get down, now.
你快下来你

695
00:58:45,800 --> 00:58:47,120
Something's off.
不对劲

696
00:58:49,320 --> 00:58:51,600
-Security comrades!
-Fuck you, Song Yukun.
-保卫科的同志
-操你妈的，宋玉坤

697
00:58:51,680 --> 00:58:53,120
-You trying to start a riot?
-Stop it, now.
-你要造反吗你？
-快住手

698
00:58:53,200 --> 00:58:54,880
-Say it, come on.
-What are you doing? Rioting?
-你说呀你
-干什么你？ 你要造反吗你？

699
00:58:54,960 --> 00:58:56,040
Jianchun.
建春

700
00:58:56,120 --> 00:58:57,120
-Somebody!
-Biaozi.
-来人
-彪子

701
00:58:57,200 --> 00:58:59,480
-Biaozi...
-Let go, today I'll...
-彪子…
-撒开，我今天我…

702
00:58:59,560 --> 00:59:01,440
-Get him... what are you doing?
-Biaozi.
-给我…干什么？
-彪子

703
00:59:02,240 --> 00:59:03,960
Have you fucking lost your mind?
你他妈吃错药了你呀？

704
00:59:04,040 --> 00:59:05,200
What do you think you're doing?
你这要干什么？

705
00:59:05,680 --> 00:59:06,920
Outrageous.
太猖狂了

706
00:59:11,800 --> 00:59:13,120
You all right, Director?
没事吧，厂长？

707
00:59:18,560 --> 00:59:20,000
-What are you doing?
-Put your back into it.
-干什么？
-使点劲

708
00:59:20,080 --> 00:59:21,080
-Hit him.
-Hit him.
-揍他
-揍他

709
00:59:21,160 --> 00:59:23,920
-Beat a man to death and you won't pay?
-Harder.
-你们打死人不偿命
-使点劲

710
00:59:24,760 --> 00:59:26,640
I... Jianchun...
我…建春…

711
00:59:26,720 --> 00:59:28,800
That's about enough with the work matters.
工作上的事你差不多行了

712
00:59:29,720 --> 00:59:31,920
Who are you to say? Fine, your call.
你是干啥的？ 听你的

713
00:59:32,000 --> 00:59:32,880
Wait.
不是

714
00:59:32,960 --> 00:59:34,200
If you beat him badly,
你打坏了

715
00:59:34,280 --> 00:59:35,800
won't you be held responsible?
你不得担责任啊？

716
00:59:37,920 --> 00:59:40,000
Wang Xiang, I'm doing this for your sake.
王响，我看你面子

717
00:59:40,080 --> 00:59:41,480
Only for you.
也就是你

718
00:59:41,560 --> 00:59:43,160
Anyone else today, and it wouldn't have worked.
今天换另外一个人都不管用的

719
00:59:43,240 --> 00:59:44,880
All right... that's enough.
好…行了

720
00:59:44,960 --> 00:59:45,880
Jianchun.
建春

721
00:59:46,920 --> 00:59:47,760
Okay.
行

722
00:59:47,840 --> 00:59:49,040
You two keep an eye on him.
你俩盯着点

723
00:59:49,680 --> 00:59:50,960
The meeting's not over.
会没开完

724
00:59:51,040 --> 00:59:52,480
Don't let him back in, you hear?
不能让他进去，听着没有？

725
00:59:52,560 --> 00:59:53,480
Get to it.
赶紧的

726
00:59:58,560 --> 00:59:59,720
I'm giving you face, let me tell you.
我给你面子，我告诉你

727
01:00:15,960 --> 01:00:19,880
Just now some comrades got rather worked up.
刚才有些同志的情绪比较激动

728
01:00:20,800 --> 01:00:22,320
That's understandable.
这个可以理解

729
01:00:22,840 --> 01:00:25,480
After all, our plant now faces a difficult historic choice.
毕竟咱们厂现在面临着 艰难的历史抉择

730
01:00:42,920 --> 01:00:44,160
Talk to me.
你跟我说说

731
01:00:44,840 --> 01:00:46,200
What's it really about?
到底因为啥？

732
01:00:52,880 --> 01:00:56,800
I see everyone's quite concerned about the layoff and furlough list, yes?
我看大家对下岗、待岗人员名单 都比较关心，是吧？

733
01:00:56,880 --> 01:00:59,440
So I'll adjust the agenda on the spot.
那我就临时改改会议进程

734
01:01:01,600 --> 01:01:04,160
I'll announce the layoff and furlough list early.
提前宣布下岗、待岗人员名单

735
01:01:06,920 --> 01:01:08,520
Speaking of layoffs and furloughs,
说到下岗、待岗

736
01:01:08,600 --> 01:01:10,360
the plant office will lead the way.
我们厂办带个头

737
01:01:11,640 --> 01:01:13,600
Plant office layoff:
厂办下岗人员

738
01:01:15,640 --> 01:01:16,800
Gong Biao.
龚彪

739
01:01:23,760 --> 01:01:25,080
Locomotive depot layoffs:
机务段下岗人员

740
01:01:25,160 --> 01:01:26,360
Zhang Youcheng.
张有成

741
01:01:27,560 --> 01:01:28,600
Hao Chenggang.
郝成钢

742
01:01:28,680 --> 01:01:30,120
This suit's no big deal anyway.
这身衣服也没啥大不了的

743
01:01:30,200 --> 01:01:31,280
Li Qing.
李庆

744
01:01:33,200 --> 01:01:34,200
Fang Zhonghua.
方中华

745
01:01:35,520 --> 01:01:37,320
Equipment section layoffs:
设备科下岗人员

746
01:01:38,880 --> 01:01:40,160
Sun Liqiang.
孙立强

747
01:01:42,320 --> 01:01:43,440
Tian Mingzhi.
田明智

748
01:01:44,360 --> 01:01:45,920
What's going on, Master Wang?
怎么回事呀，王师傅？

749
01:01:46,000 --> 01:01:47,640
Jiang Yanquan.
蒋彦全

750
01:01:53,360 --> 01:01:54,880
Comrade Wang Xiang, is there something?
王响同志，有事吗？

751
01:01:57,680 --> 01:02:00,040
You're a real fucking piece of garbage.
你他妈真是个杂碎

752
01:02:06,160 --> 01:02:07,840
-Seen Biaozi?
-He was on stage just now.
-看见彪子了吗？
-刚才还在台上呢

753
01:02:08,400 --> 01:02:09,680
What did you say?
你说啥？

754
01:02:10,680 --> 01:02:11,520
Garbage.
杂碎

755
01:02:12,160 --> 01:02:13,320
From the locomotive depot.
机务段的

756
01:02:18,880 --> 01:02:20,080
Pull them apart...
拉开…

757
01:02:21,440 --> 01:02:22,280
Stop fighting.
别打了

758
01:02:35,160 --> 01:02:37,000
A bunch of fucking useless idiots.
他妈一群废物

759
01:02:37,560 --> 01:02:39,480
What's your security section even good for?
你们保卫科干什么吃的你？

760
01:02:39,960 --> 01:02:41,640
Can't even hold back a few workers.
几个工人都拦不住

761
01:02:42,120 --> 01:02:43,920
Director, don't worry.
厂长，您放心

762
01:02:44,000 --> 01:02:46,160
Anyone who went up on that stage won't get away.
只要是上台的，谁都别想跑

763
01:02:46,240 --> 01:02:47,600
-We'll deal with them one by one.
-Right.
-挨个收拾他
-对

764
01:02:47,680 --> 01:02:49,440
Handle it firmly, make an example.
严肃处理，举一反三

765
01:02:49,520 --> 01:02:50,440
Deal with it firmly.
给我严肃处理

766
01:02:50,520 --> 01:02:51,400
It must be dealt with firmly.
必须严肃处理

767
01:02:51,480 --> 01:02:53,040
Especially that ringleader, Wang Xiang.
尤其是那个带头的王响

768
01:02:53,120 --> 01:02:54,200
I'll deal with him first.
我第一个就收拾他

769
01:02:54,880 --> 01:02:55,840
Calm down.
消消气

770
01:03:07,600 --> 01:03:09,560
Director, is it out of order?
厂长，不走字了？

771
01:03:09,640 --> 01:03:11,080
Get lost.
滚一边去

772
01:03:11,160 --> 01:03:12,360
Who are you two? Who are you looking for?
你俩干啥的？ 找谁呀？

773
01:03:12,440 --> 01:03:13,520
Is Song Yukun in?
宋玉坤在吧？

774
01:03:13,600 --> 01:03:15,520
Look, the director's busy, out you go...
不是，厂长挺忙的，出去…

775
01:03:16,000 --> 01:03:18,240
I'm talking to you two, hear me?
我跟你俩说话呢，听见没有？

776
01:03:19,760 --> 01:03:20,600
Song Yukun, right?
宋玉坤吧？

777
01:03:20,680 --> 01:03:22,560
Hey, just who are you?
不是，你是干啥的你是？

778
01:03:22,640 --> 01:03:24,120
We're from the Municipal Discipline Commission.
我们是市纪委的

779
01:03:25,200 --> 01:03:27,240
You've been reported for embezzling state assets,
有人举报你侵吞国有资产

780
01:03:27,320 --> 01:03:29,720
and for retaliating against workers under the guise of layoffs.
以下岗的名义打击报复工人

781
01:03:29,800 --> 01:03:31,320
Please cooperate with our investigation.
请你配合我们调查

782
01:03:54,600 --> 01:03:56,280
Quick to respond.
出警挺快

783
01:03:57,840 --> 01:03:59,200
Detaining me, are you?
要拘我呀？

784
01:04:00,480 --> 01:04:01,480
Let's go.
来吧

785
01:04:06,520 --> 01:04:07,480
Wang Yang.
王阳

786
01:04:10,480 --> 01:04:11,640
Found him.
找着了

787
01:04:23,040 --> 01:04:24,000
What are you doing? You can't go in.
你干啥？ 这不让进

788
01:04:24,080 --> 01:04:25,160
-I'm going in.
-Comrade, please cooperate.
-我进去
-同志，你配合一下

789
01:04:25,240 --> 01:04:26,360
Let him in.
让他进去

790
01:04:26,440 --> 01:04:27,360
Captain Ma.
马队

791
01:04:38,760 --> 01:04:39,760
Cui.
崔

792
01:04:43,120 --> 01:04:44,040
Is it Wang Yang?
是王阳吗？

793
01:04:47,240 --> 01:04:48,360
There's been a mistake, right?
整错了吧？

794
01:04:53,520 --> 01:04:54,920
It's a mistake, isn't it?
是不是整错了？

795
01:05:06,440 --> 01:05:07,440
Fang He.
方赫

796
01:05:21,480 --> 01:05:22,440
Get up.
起来

797
01:05:24,040 --> 01:05:25,480
What are you doing lying here?
在这躺着干啥？

798
01:05:27,120 --> 01:05:28,760
If you want to sleep, go home and sleep.
乐意睡，回家睡去

799
01:05:31,840 --> 01:05:32,840
Get up.
起来

800
01:05:35,760 --> 01:05:36,800
Be good.
听话

801
01:05:56,640 --> 01:05:57,600
Yang'er.
阳儿

802
01:06:00,640 --> 01:06:01,800
Yang'er.
阳儿

803
01:06:02,360 --> 01:06:04,080
Yang'er, don't scare your dad.
阳儿，你别吓唬爸

804
01:06:06,360 --> 01:06:07,280
Yang'er.
阳儿

805
01:06:08,880 --> 01:06:10,320
Yang'er, get up.
阳儿，你起来

806
01:06:10,400 --> 01:06:11,760
Get up, let's go home.
你起来回家

807
01:06:14,560 --> 01:06:16,520
Yang'er, get up.
阳儿，你起来

808
01:06:16,600 --> 01:06:18,680
Yang'er, let's go home.
阳儿，回家

809
01:06:20,880 --> 01:06:22,560
Dad won't scold you ever again.
爸再也不说你了

810
01:06:23,720 --> 01:06:25,960
Do whatever you want.
你愿意干啥你就干啥

811
01:06:28,200 --> 01:06:29,160
Get up.
起来

812
01:06:31,040 --> 01:06:32,760
Mom's still at home waiting for you.
妈还在家等你呢

813
01:06:34,520 --> 01:06:37,200
You and I still have to go to Beijing.
咱爷俩还得去北京

814
01:06:40,160 --> 01:06:41,160
Yang'er.
阳儿

815
01:06:42,160 --> 01:06:45,320
Yang'er... don't scare me.
阳儿…你别吓唬我

816
01:06:47,080 --> 01:06:49,360
Don't scare me, Yang'er.
你别吓我，阳儿

817
01:06:50,880 --> 01:06:53,160
Yang'er... don't...
阳儿…你别…

818
01:06:53,240 --> 01:06:58,800
Yang'er, don't scare your dad...
阳儿，你别吓唬爸…

819
01:07:01,360 --> 01:07:04,520
Don't scare your dad.
你别吓唬爸

820
01:07:21,240 --> 01:07:22,440
What flowers?
买啥花？

821
01:07:23,560 --> 01:07:25,040
What flowers do people give as gifts?
送人都选啥花呢？

822
01:07:25,120 --> 01:07:27,640
For visiting the sick, usually these — they bloom just in water.
看病人一般这种，插水就能开

823
01:07:27,720 --> 01:07:29,280
And they don't cause allergies.
而且不过敏

824
01:07:29,360 --> 01:07:32,080
Not for a patient — for a friend.
不看病人，送朋友

825
01:07:32,160 --> 01:07:35,120
You know, the... female kind of friend.
就是那种女的那个朋友

826
01:07:36,040 --> 01:07:37,040
Then let me give you a hand.
那我帮你搭一把吧

827
01:07:37,120 --> 01:07:38,080
Okay...
好…

828
01:07:38,160 --> 01:07:39,360
Boss.
老板

829
01:07:39,440 --> 01:07:40,720
-Just these, wrap them up for me.
-Sure.
-就要这些，帮我包一下
-好的

830
01:07:40,800 --> 01:07:43,560
-Sure... let me help him first.
-Okay...
-好的…我先帮他一下啊
-好…

831
01:07:52,760 --> 01:07:54,360
-Buying flowers?
-Buying flowers.
-买花？
-买花

832
01:07:59,000 --> 01:08:00,080
For your girlfriend?
送女朋友？

833
01:08:05,040 --> 01:08:06,600
Just get the same as mine.
你和我整一样的得了

834
01:08:07,240 --> 01:08:09,920
Eleven roses, two lilies.
11朵玫瑰，2朵百合

835
01:08:11,120 --> 01:08:12,680
Is there a meaning to it?
这有什么讲啊？

836
01:08:13,280 --> 01:08:15,680
Whole-hearted devotion, a hundred years of harmony.
一心一意，百年好合

837
01:08:17,120 --> 01:08:18,520
That's a lovely meaning.
这意思可好

838
01:08:19,439 --> 01:08:20,479
Very nice.
挺好

839
01:08:22,680 --> 01:08:24,160
Say, little brother,
老弟，你说

840
01:08:24,880 --> 01:08:27,479
I want to convey a bit of an apology too.
我想再表达一点歉意

841
01:08:27,560 --> 01:08:29,160
Just to say sorry, that sort of thing.
就是道个歉啥的

842
01:08:29,240 --> 01:08:30,920
What flower should I add for that?
再加点什么花呢？

843
01:08:31,479 --> 01:08:32,640
Add some forget-me-nots.
整点勿忘我

844
01:08:32,720 --> 01:08:33,880
Okay.
好

845
01:08:33,960 --> 01:08:36,960
"Don't forget me, don't hold it against me."
别忘了我，别挑我理

846
01:08:40,080 --> 01:08:41,240
Your flowers.
您的花

847
01:08:41,319 --> 01:08:42,439
Thanks, boss.
谢谢呀，老板

848
01:08:42,520 --> 01:08:43,800
-Take care.
-Thanks.
-慢走啊
-谢谢

849
01:08:44,520 --> 01:08:45,880
-Goodbye.
-Okay...
-再见
-好…

850
01:08:48,240 --> 01:08:49,840
Eleven roses,
11朵玫瑰

851
01:08:49,920 --> 01:08:51,439
two lilies,
两枝百合

852
01:08:51,520 --> 01:08:52,520
and extra forget-me-nots.
多加勿忘我

853
01:08:52,600 --> 01:08:53,920
-You got it.
-Extra.
-好咧，好
-多加

854
01:08:54,000 --> 01:08:55,080
Okay.
好

855
01:09:00,479 --> 01:09:02,200
Little brother, need a cab?
老弟，你打车呀？

856
01:09:02,760 --> 01:09:04,200
Here... I'll give you a ride, come on.
来…我拉你，来

857
01:09:04,760 --> 01:09:05,680
Is that all right?
方便吗？

858
01:09:05,760 --> 01:09:06,920
Don't you have somewhere to be?
你不有事吗？

859
01:09:07,000 --> 01:09:08,240
Where are you headed?
你要去哪啊？

860
01:09:08,800 --> 01:09:10,200
To Culture Street to pick someone up.
去文化街接个人

861
01:09:10,920 --> 01:09:12,600
Then hop in, it's right on the way.
那你上来吧，正好顺路

862
01:09:12,680 --> 01:09:14,080
No charge.
不要钱

863
01:09:14,600 --> 01:09:16,160
Thanks for being my advisor.
感谢你给我当参谋

864
01:09:16,240 --> 01:09:17,880
-Then I won't stand on ceremony.
-Good.
-那就不客气了
-好

865
01:09:19,640 --> 01:09:21,200
Here, hold this for me.
来，帮我拿一下

866
01:09:21,279 --> 01:09:22,160
Okay...
好…

867
01:09:22,240 --> 01:09:24,040
-Don't mix them up.
-Okay.
-别弄混了啊
-好

868
01:09:24,120 --> 01:09:26,520
-The one with forget-me-nots is mine.
-Okay.
-勿忘我那个是我的
-好

869
01:09:27,000 --> 01:09:27,920
Here.
来

870
01:09:37,240 --> 01:09:38,800
Off to see your girlfriend?
见女朋友去吧？

871
01:09:41,600 --> 01:09:43,200
Well... not exactly.
也…也不算

872
01:09:43,279 --> 01:09:45,080
We haven't made it official yet.
还没确定关系呢

873
01:09:45,880 --> 01:09:47,479
I plan to bring it up with her today.
今天准备跟她提

874
01:09:48,000 --> 01:09:49,479
I'm a bit unsure.
心里有点没底

875
01:09:50,319 --> 01:09:51,680
No problem.
没问题

876
01:09:52,720 --> 01:09:55,200
Little brother, with your air and bearing,
老弟呀，就你这个精神气质呀

877
01:09:55,280 --> 01:09:57,320
I'm telling you, one look and you're the refined type.
讲话了，一看儒雅

878
01:09:58,480 --> 01:10:00,000
There's no way it won't work out.
没有不成的道理

879
01:10:00,800 --> 01:10:02,160
From your lips to God's ears.
借你吉言

880
01:10:03,880 --> 01:10:05,360
What do you do for work?
干啥工作的？

881
01:10:06,760 --> 01:10:09,360
I used to teach in the academic office at No. 10 Middle School.
以前在十中教务处当老师

882
01:10:09,440 --> 01:10:10,560
Retired last year.
去年退了

883
01:10:11,080 --> 01:10:14,080
Let me tell you, I drive a cab every day,
我跟你说，我天天开计程车

884
01:10:14,160 --> 01:10:15,320
I meet a lot of people,
见的人多

885
01:10:15,800 --> 01:10:16,800
I've got a sharp eye.
眼睛毒

886
01:10:16,880 --> 01:10:18,720
One look and I can tell you're an educated man.
一看你就是个文化人

887
01:10:21,000 --> 01:10:22,880
You teachers,
你们当老师的

888
01:10:22,960 --> 01:10:25,080
your retirement benefits are pretty good, right?
退休待遇是不是挺高啊？

889
01:10:25,160 --> 01:10:26,280
They're all right, I suppose.
这还行吧

890
01:10:26,360 --> 01:10:28,480
Anyway, the pension goes up every year.
反正工资年年都涨

891
01:10:29,960 --> 01:10:31,600
My wife passed early.
我爱人没得早

892
01:10:32,160 --> 01:10:33,480
The kids are all on their own.
儿女也都独立了

893
01:10:33,560 --> 01:10:34,480
Now...
现在…

894
01:10:35,160 --> 01:10:36,520
I don't have big expenses.
没啥大花销

895
01:10:38,080 --> 01:10:39,840
So I get by fairly comfortably.
就算比较从容吧

896
01:10:40,680 --> 01:10:42,880
That's a good situation.
这条件不错

897
01:10:43,720 --> 01:10:45,160
Find yourself a good companion,
再找个好老伴

898
01:10:45,720 --> 01:10:46,800
and your days
小日子

899
01:10:47,440 --> 01:10:48,600
would be just great.
老得劲了

900
01:10:55,840 --> 01:10:58,200
Qiaoyun, don't worry.
巧云，妳别着急

901
01:10:58,280 --> 01:10:59,680
I've got a cab.
打上车了啊

902
01:10:59,760 --> 01:11:00,800
I'll be there soon.
马上就到

903
01:11:11,560 --> 01:11:12,640
Little brother,
老弟

904
01:11:13,400 --> 01:11:17,240
was your... your girlfriend once with Hualin Steel?
你…你女朋友过去是桦钢的吗？

905
01:11:17,760 --> 01:11:18,880
Yes.
是呀

906
01:11:18,960 --> 01:11:21,120
Now she... she runs a massage parlor.
现…现在开家推拿店

907
01:11:21,200 --> 01:11:23,000
Why? You know her?
怎么的？ 你认识啊？

908
01:11:24,640 --> 01:11:26,640
The name sounds familiar.
名听着耳熟

909
01:11:28,280 --> 01:11:29,800
Might recognize her when I see her.
见面兴许能认识

910
01:11:30,560 --> 01:11:31,560
What a coincidence.
那可巧了

911
01:11:33,040 --> 01:11:34,840
She often mentions things about you folks at Hualin Steel.
她老提你们桦钢的事

912
01:11:35,560 --> 01:11:37,200
She just finished her retirement paperwork.
这不刚办完退休嘛

913
01:11:37,920 --> 01:11:40,000
She says she wants to close the massage parlor.
她说想把推拿店给关了

914
01:11:40,080 --> 01:11:43,080
Then the two of us will travel around, see some places.
到时候我俩就各地走一走，旅旅游

915
01:11:43,840 --> 01:11:45,760
Spend our later years together in peace, I suppose.
一起安度晚年吧就算

916
01:11:48,800 --> 01:11:51,160
Driver, turn at the Culture Street intersection.
师傅，文化街路口拐

917
01:11:56,360 --> 01:11:58,720
You... turn up ahead and just pull over.
你…你前面拐过去，给我靠边停就行

918
01:11:58,800 --> 01:12:00,280
She's waiting for me at the roadside.
她在道边等我呢

919
01:12:13,240 --> 01:12:14,480
Went and bought you flowers.
给妳买花去了

920
01:12:14,560 --> 01:12:15,840
These are yours.
这是您的

921
01:12:16,360 --> 01:12:17,760
It was hard to catch a cab over there.
那边不好打车

922
01:12:17,840 --> 01:12:20,000
Luckily I ran into this driver who gave me a lift.
正好遇上这师傅给我捎过来了

923
01:12:20,080 --> 01:12:21,600
He used to be with Hualin Steel too.
他以前也是桦钢的

924
01:12:21,680 --> 01:12:22,760
Isn't that a coincidence?
妳說巧不巧？

925
01:12:23,240 --> 01:12:24,160
Li Qiaoyun.
李巧云

926
01:12:24,640 --> 01:12:26,240
Are you Li Qiaoyun?
是不是李巧云？

927
01:12:27,360 --> 01:12:28,600
Do you remember?
想起来没？

928
01:12:29,640 --> 01:12:31,000
From the locomotive depot.
机务段的

929
01:12:32,760 --> 01:12:33,760
Surname Wang.
姓王

930
01:12:37,760 --> 01:12:39,440
I remember, Master Wang.
我记着，王师傅

931
01:12:40,960 --> 01:12:41,880
I remember.
记着呢

932
01:12:42,560 --> 01:12:43,520
What a coincidence.
巧了

933
01:12:44,920 --> 01:12:47,040
Shall we ride with him, then?
那咱还坐他车吧？

934
01:12:47,880 --> 01:12:49,760
Master Wang and I hit it off nicely.
我和王师傅聊得挺投机的

935
01:12:50,520 --> 01:12:51,880
We're going to Daguang Mall.
我们去大光商场

936
01:12:51,960 --> 01:12:53,800
Would you mind giving us a lift a bit further?
您再捎我们一段，方不方便？

937
01:12:53,880 --> 01:12:55,320
Sure...
方便…

938
01:12:55,400 --> 01:12:56,760
I can't drive you for free this time, though.
这回不能白拉了啊

939
01:12:56,840 --> 01:12:57,880
Okay...
好…

940
01:12:58,640 --> 01:13:00,560
Here, Qiaoyun, flowers for you.
来，巧云，送妳的花

941
01:13:09,760 --> 01:13:10,840
Are you hungry?
妳饿不饿？

942
01:13:11,600 --> 01:13:14,480
Should we eat first, or see the movie first?
一会咱俩是先吃饭，还是先看电影？

943
01:13:18,160 --> 01:13:19,160
Either's fine.
都行

944
01:13:21,640 --> 01:13:23,520
Then let's eat first.
那咱们就先吃饭

945
01:13:25,040 --> 01:13:26,800
Anything you feel like eating?
妳有啥想吃的没有？

946
01:13:27,840 --> 01:13:28,800
Anything's fine.
都行

947
01:13:30,480 --> 01:13:32,160
Okay, let me look it up.
好，我查查

948
01:13:46,520 --> 01:13:47,440
Master Wang.
王师傅

949
01:13:49,320 --> 01:13:51,960
Those flowers of yours are lovely.
你这花挺好看啊

950
01:13:54,320 --> 01:13:57,920
This little brother here helped me pick them.
是我这个老弟帮着选的

951
01:13:58,520 --> 01:14:00,320
Exactly the same as his.
跟他的一模一样

952
01:14:01,640 --> 01:14:03,560
Added some forget-me-nots.
加了点勿忘我

953
01:14:05,320 --> 01:14:06,600
It's just...
就是…

954
01:14:07,400 --> 01:14:08,880
"Don't hold a grudge against me."
别记恨我

955
01:14:09,880 --> 01:14:11,920
A bit of an apology.
有点道歉的意思

956
01:14:13,680 --> 01:14:15,200
Driving the two of us,
那你拉我俩

957
01:14:15,280 --> 01:14:16,880
won't it keep you from delivering your flowers?
不耽误你送花啊？

958
01:14:17,440 --> 01:14:18,600
It won't.
不耽误

959
01:14:19,680 --> 01:14:23,000
That person's also an old-timer from Hualin Steel.
那人也是桦钢的老人

960
01:14:23,080 --> 01:14:24,880
Whether I deliver them or not,
我送不送的

961
01:14:24,960 --> 01:14:27,000
she'll understand what I mean.
她都能明白我的意思

962
01:14:30,560 --> 01:14:32,960
Do I know this person you're giving flowers to?
你送花的这人我认识吗？

963
01:14:34,840 --> 01:14:36,240
You probably do.
应该认识

964
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:39,920
She worked the weighbridge in the scale house.
她是磅房过磅的

965
01:14:41,960 --> 01:14:43,440
A good person.
人挺好

966
01:14:45,480 --> 01:14:47,680
She's had a hard life.
这辈子挺不容易的

967
01:14:48,560 --> 01:14:49,640
Proud and strong-willed.
要强

968
01:14:51,440 --> 01:14:54,520
But when other women ran into trouble,
可是别的女同志遇着点啥事

969
01:14:55,000 --> 01:14:56,360
they'd always cry and wail.
总是哭啼的

970
01:14:56,920 --> 01:14:58,280
She stayed cheerful.
她乐呵的

971
01:14:59,960 --> 01:15:01,720
Quite admirable.
挺让人佩服的

972
01:15:16,400 --> 01:15:19,520
So you never thought of taking things a step further with her?
那你就没想着跟她往前走一步呢？

973
01:15:25,240 --> 01:15:26,320
How to put it...
怎么回事呢？

974
01:15:26,400 --> 01:15:29,640
It's just, lately I've been through some things.
就是最近我遇着点事

975
01:15:30,880 --> 01:15:33,600
I've come across a lot of us old Hualin Steel folks.
接触不少我们桦钢的老人

976
01:15:34,360 --> 01:15:35,520
And I've realized,
我就发现啊

977
01:15:35,600 --> 01:15:39,200
no matter how they've fared, however their lives turned out,
人家不管过得好坏，活成啥样

978
01:15:39,280 --> 01:15:40,840
they can all look ahead.
都能往前看

979
01:15:41,400 --> 01:15:42,360
But not me.
我就不行

980
01:15:43,120 --> 01:15:44,800
I just can't get past it.
老过不去那个劲

981
01:15:45,760 --> 01:15:48,920
I heard this friend of mine is doing well now.
我听人说我这个朋友现在过得挺好

982
01:15:49,400 --> 01:15:50,840
After the bitter comes the sweet.
苦尽甘来

983
01:15:51,360 --> 01:15:53,040
I'm happy for her.
挺替她高兴的

984
01:15:54,080 --> 01:15:57,520
I just want her to live the rest of her life in comfort.
我就想让她后半辈子过得舒心一点

985
01:15:59,280 --> 01:16:02,480
Not to fret and worry over a little old man like me.
别跟我这个小老头担惊受怕

986
01:16:03,160 --> 01:16:04,360
All bottled up and wronged.
憋了吧屈的

987
01:16:04,880 --> 01:16:06,000
It's not worth it.
犯不上

988
01:16:06,840 --> 01:16:09,560
Master Wang, you're sentimental about the past.
王师傅，你这是念旧

989
01:16:11,240 --> 01:16:12,840
Sentimental, if you want to put it nicely.
说好听是念旧

990
01:16:13,920 --> 01:16:15,600
Really it's just being stubborn to a fault.
其实就是爱钻牛角尖

991
01:16:16,280 --> 01:16:17,400
Not quick in the head.
脑袋不灵活

992
01:16:18,320 --> 01:16:19,480
Pretty annoying.
挺烦人的

993
01:16:24,080 --> 01:16:25,800
Why are you crying, Qiaoyun?
妳怎么哭了，巧云？

994
01:16:27,320 --> 01:16:28,320
It's nothing.
没事

995
01:16:31,800 --> 01:16:32,960
It's nothing.
没事

996
01:16:34,160 --> 01:16:37,320
I was just remembering some things from the past too.
我也是想起点过去的事

997
01:16:38,800 --> 01:16:40,080
Take my word.
信我的

998
01:16:41,320 --> 01:16:42,920
Don't dwell on the past.
不想过去的事

999
01:16:43,400 --> 01:16:45,360
What's past, let it stay past.
过去了就让它过去

1000
01:16:45,840 --> 01:16:46,880
Look ahead.
往前看

1001
01:16:49,440 --> 01:16:50,400
Right.
对

1002
01:16:51,160 --> 01:16:52,400
Look ahead.
往前看

1003
01:16:54,840 --> 01:16:56,040
Look ahead.
往前看

1004
01:17:09,960 --> 01:17:11,160
Master Wang, how much?
王师傅，多少钱？

1005
01:17:11,640 --> 01:17:13,040
No charge, little brother.
不用掏钱了，老弟

1006
01:17:13,520 --> 01:17:15,080
Just do me one favor.
有个事拜托一下

1007
01:17:16,040 --> 01:17:18,400
Be good to our Qiaoyun from now on.
以后对我们巧云好点

1008
01:17:18,880 --> 01:17:21,120
Or us old workmates won't stand for it.
不然我们老工友们不答应你

1009
01:17:22,120 --> 01:17:23,400
I will...
一定…

1010
01:17:23,480 --> 01:17:24,520
Thank you.
谢谢呀

1011
01:17:28,120 --> 01:17:29,840
Qiaoyun, let's get out.
巧云，下车啊

1012
01:17:34,520 --> 01:17:36,080
Thank you, Master Wang.
谢谢呀，王师傅

1013
01:17:42,880 --> 01:17:43,880
Little brother.
老弟呀

1014
01:17:47,760 --> 01:17:49,040
I wish you both well.
祝福你们

1015
01:17:49,600 --> 01:17:51,280
-This...
-I'm past my use now.
-这…
-我没用了我

1016
01:17:53,440 --> 01:17:54,920
Forget-me-not.
勿忘我啊

1017
01:17:56,040 --> 01:17:58,480
Thank you...
谢谢…

1018
01:18:05,040 --> 01:18:07,040
Master Wang's a really warm person.
王师傅这人真挺热情

1019
01:18:14,080 --> 01:18:15,360
His name is Wang Xiang.
他叫王响

1020
01:18:15,960 --> 01:18:17,480
"Xiang" as in "xiangliang" — resounding.
“响亮”的“响”

1021
01:18:30,160 --> 01:18:31,200
Biaozi.
彪子

1022
01:18:33,080 --> 01:18:35,040
This matter's settled now.
这事就算完了

1023
01:18:35,120 --> 01:18:36,920
These few copies are yours.
这几份是你的

1024
01:18:38,120 --> 01:18:39,520
Keep them safe.
都拿好了

1025
01:18:42,320 --> 01:18:43,840
Give me that license too.
把那证也给我吧

1026
01:18:45,320 --> 01:18:46,600
What do you want that license for?
你要这证干啥？

1027
01:18:46,680 --> 01:18:47,960
It's void now.
都作废了

1028
01:18:48,040 --> 01:18:49,640
I'll... keep it as a memento.
我…我留个纪念

1029
01:18:49,720 --> 01:18:51,640
It's got my photo on it.
那上边还有我照片呢

1030
01:18:52,240 --> 01:18:53,160
Fine.
得

1031
01:18:53,760 --> 01:18:55,320
I've already arranged it with someone.
我都跟人说好了

1032
01:18:55,400 --> 01:18:57,240
I'll drive the car over by the end of the month.
月底把车开过去啊

1033
01:18:57,320 --> 01:18:58,160
Don't worry.
放心吧

1034
01:18:58,240 --> 01:19:00,280
I'll clean it up nice and deliver it to you.
到时候我整干净的，给你送过去

1035
01:19:00,360 --> 01:19:01,360
Okay.
行

1036
01:19:02,160 --> 01:19:03,200
Thanks.
谢谢啊

1037
01:19:08,200 --> 01:19:10,200
(Hualin City Taxi Driver Service Qualification License)
（桦林市计程车汽车驾驶员 服务资格证）

1038
01:19:34,960 --> 01:19:36,800
Your sign would look so much better hung over there.
你这牌挂那边多好啊

1039
01:19:36,880 --> 01:19:38,120
So much more eye-catching.
多醒目啊

1040
01:19:38,680 --> 01:19:41,080
Hung there, people coming from that side can't even see it.
你挂那，从那边过来，人也看不见啊

1041
01:19:41,760 --> 01:19:42,600
Who are you?
你谁呀？

1042
01:19:42,680 --> 01:19:43,680
Who am I?
我谁呀？

1043
01:19:43,760 --> 01:19:45,600
I'm the owner of this shop, who am I?
我这店老板，我谁呀？

1044
01:19:47,920 --> 01:19:49,000
Thanks for your hard work.
辛苦了啊

1045
01:19:50,080 --> 01:19:50,920
Thanks, boss.
谢谢老板

1046
01:19:51,000 --> 01:19:52,000
Here, catch.
接好了

1047
01:19:53,760 --> 01:19:54,720
Been too busy lately.
最近太忙了

1048
01:19:54,800 --> 01:19:55,920
Haven't come by much.
没怎么过来看

1049
01:19:56,400 --> 01:19:57,480
Where's your Boss Huang?
你们黄总呢？

1050
01:19:58,280 --> 01:19:59,560
Inside, I take it?
在屋里吧？

1051
01:20:00,480 --> 01:20:02,320
All right, you all get to it.
那行，你们好好整吧

1052
01:20:02,400 --> 01:20:03,720
Hang it over here.
挂这边啊

1053
01:20:15,520 --> 01:20:18,040
Master, mainly you've got to smooth out the edges and corners up top.
师傅，你主要上边 那边边角角得抹好了

1054
01:20:18,120 --> 01:20:19,680
-You know? Then let it dry all the way through.
-You got it.
-你知道吗？ 然后得干透啊
-好咧

1055
01:20:19,760 --> 01:20:21,600
-Once it's fully dry, do a second coat.
-Sure.
-干透完了抹第二遍
-行

1056
01:20:27,200 --> 01:20:28,080
What are you doing here?
你怎么来了？

1057
01:20:29,480 --> 01:20:31,320
Coming along quite nicely.
整得挺像样啊

1058
01:20:33,000 --> 01:20:34,960
Whatever it is, say it at home; I'm swamped here.
你有啥事回家说吧，我这老忙了

1059
01:20:35,040 --> 01:20:37,080
Look at this place, all in a mess.
你瞅这，弄得乱糟糟的

1060
01:20:37,600 --> 01:20:40,040
You don't answer my calls, don't reply on WeChat.
我给妳打电话也不接，微信也不回

1061
01:20:40,920 --> 01:20:41,760
What's wrong?
怎么的了？

1062
01:20:42,360 --> 01:20:44,160
Trying to spring a surprise on me?
想给我整个意外惊喜啊？

1063
01:20:44,920 --> 01:20:46,280
What surprise?
什么意外惊喜？

1064
01:20:47,320 --> 01:20:48,760
Don't be angry now.
别生气了啊

1065
01:20:49,360 --> 01:20:51,200
So petty.
心眼那小呢

1066
01:20:51,280 --> 01:20:52,840
Enough, stop the tugging and pulling here.
行了，别在这拉拉扯扯的

1067
01:20:52,920 --> 01:20:53,840
What's the matter with you?
干什么玩意？

1068
01:20:53,920 --> 01:20:54,960
Is this going to go on forever?
没完没了了？

1069
01:20:55,040 --> 01:20:57,960
-What? Stop yanking me, that hurts.
-What's going on, Liru?
-干什么？ 你别老拽我，我疼
-怎么了，丽茹？

1070
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:01,080
Who's this?
这谁啊？

1071
01:21:02,480 --> 01:21:03,920
My husband, Gong Biao.
我爱人，龚彪

1072
01:21:05,960 --> 01:21:07,200
This is Brother Hao.
这是郝哥

1073
01:21:07,680 --> 01:21:08,640
Biaozi?
彪子？

1074
01:21:09,200 --> 01:21:10,640
Liru's always mentioning you.
老听丽茹提你

1075
01:21:13,120 --> 01:21:14,920
How come you're not out driving today?
你今儿怎么没出车呀？

1076
01:21:16,120 --> 01:21:17,080
Who's this?
谁呀？

1077
01:21:17,640 --> 01:21:19,800
Brother Hao? A business partner.
郝哥吗？ 合伙人

1078
01:21:21,760 --> 01:21:22,920
Brother Hao.
郝哥呀

1079
01:21:24,720 --> 01:21:26,160
Quite the stylish one.
挺有派呀

1080
01:21:27,080 --> 01:21:28,360
What line of work?
干啥工作的？

1081
01:21:28,440 --> 01:21:29,640
A little business here and there.
做点小买卖

1082
01:21:31,120 --> 01:21:33,000
Just bought into Boss Huang's place here.
这不刚在黄总这入股嘛

1083
01:21:33,680 --> 01:21:36,760
I've got a few repair shops over in Daowai too.
我在道外还有几家维修厂

1084
01:21:36,840 --> 01:21:38,640
Anything wrong with your car, just come by.
你的车有啥毛病直接过去

1085
01:21:38,720 --> 01:21:39,600
Just mention my name.
提我就行啊

1086
01:21:39,680 --> 01:21:41,240
-Here.
-I'm not used to these.
-来
-我抽不惯这个

1087
01:21:41,840 --> 01:21:43,080
Nothing's wrong with my car.
我车没问题

1088
01:21:43,160 --> 01:21:45,000
What I've got now is a problem with my marriage.
我现在感情有问题

1089
01:21:45,080 --> 01:21:45,960
Can you fix that?
能修啊？

1090
01:21:47,880 --> 01:21:49,520
What do you mean, Biaozi?
啥意思呀，彪子？

1091
01:21:49,600 --> 01:21:51,320
Watch your words.
说话注意点分寸啊

1092
01:21:51,400 --> 01:21:52,520
Don't call me Biaozi.
别彪子

1093
01:21:52,600 --> 01:21:54,080
Is "Biaozi" for you to say?
彪子是你叫的？

1094
01:21:54,160 --> 01:21:55,120
Call me Brother Biao.
叫彪哥

1095
01:21:55,200 --> 01:21:57,440
What's this? Why are you bickering with people?
怎么说的？ 跟人吵吵嚷嚷干啥？

1096
01:21:57,520 --> 01:21:59,280
What are you staring at? Get back to work.
你看啥看呢？ 干你活

1097
01:21:59,360 --> 01:22:00,880
-What's it got to do with him?
-It's fine.
-跟人家有什么关系呀？
-没事

1098
01:22:00,960 --> 01:22:02,600
Come on, let's talk outside, come.
来，出来说，来

1099
01:22:05,240 --> 01:22:07,200
No, where'd this Brother Hao come from?
不，哪冒出这么个郝哥呀？

1100
01:22:07,280 --> 01:22:08,360
What's so great about him?
他哪好他呀？

1101
01:22:08,440 --> 01:22:10,000
Acting so arrogant with me.
跟我这嚣张的

1102
01:22:10,080 --> 01:22:11,440
What exactly is between you two?
你俩到底啥关系呀？

1103
01:22:11,920 --> 01:22:13,240
Do you have amnesia or something?
你是不是有健忘症啊你？

1104
01:22:13,320 --> 01:22:14,520
Didn't I just tell you inside?
我里面跟你说没说？

1105
01:22:14,600 --> 01:22:15,680
A business partner.
合伙人

1106
01:22:15,760 --> 01:22:18,080
He puts up the money, I provide the skills — anything wrong with that?
人家出钱，我出技术，有毛病吗？

1107
01:22:18,640 --> 01:22:20,040
Why go into business with him?
妳跟他合啥伙啊？

1108
01:22:20,120 --> 01:22:21,920
Isn't building a life together its own partnership, just us two?
那过日子不咱俩合伙吗？

1109
01:22:24,160 --> 01:22:26,440
If you're going to think dirty like that, then there's nothing to discuss.
你要是往那脏里想，咱俩就不用唠了

1110
01:22:27,080 --> 01:22:27,960
No, Liru.
不是，丽茹

1111
01:22:28,440 --> 01:22:29,440
I didn't mean it that way.
我没那意思

1112
01:22:29,520 --> 01:22:30,440
What's the matter with you?
干什么玩意？

1113
01:22:30,520 --> 01:22:32,520
You ignore my messages just to spite me, don't you?
妳不回我信不就为了气我吗？

1114
01:22:33,320 --> 01:22:35,400
Buying the car behind your back — I was in the wrong, true.
我偷摸买车这事确实干得不对

1115
01:22:36,080 --> 01:22:37,960
But haven't I sincerely apologized to you already?
我不已经郑重给妳道歉了吗？

1116
01:22:39,320 --> 01:22:41,600
Besides, even the worst offense has its limit.
再说杀人不过头点地呢

1117
01:22:42,680 --> 01:22:45,480
A married couple quarrels at the head of the bed and makes up at the foot, right?
那夫妻俩不就床头吵吵床尾合吗？

1118
01:22:46,520 --> 01:22:48,600
Besides, I've been staying at my brother-in-law's these past few days.
另外，这几天我一直住姐夫家呢

1119
01:22:48,680 --> 01:22:49,880
I haven't been anywhere.
我哪都没去

1120
01:22:49,960 --> 01:22:51,280
You can be absolutely sure of that.
这点妳绝对放心

1121
01:22:51,800 --> 01:22:53,120
I'm not worried.
我没不放心

1122
01:22:53,960 --> 01:22:55,560
I couldn't care less.
我压根就不关心

1123
01:22:58,360 --> 01:22:59,800
Give me a little more time.
妳再给我点时间

1124
01:22:59,880 --> 01:23:01,160
We won't use anyone else's money.
咱不用别人钱了

1125
01:23:05,200 --> 01:23:06,480
Biaozi, it's not about money for us.
彪子，咱俩不是钱的事

1126
01:23:06,560 --> 01:23:08,040
My divorcing you isn't about money.
我跟你离婚不是钱的事

1127
01:23:08,120 --> 01:23:10,680
Then I don't get it — what else is it about?
那我就闹不明白了，妳还因为啥呀？

1128
01:23:10,760 --> 01:23:12,200
Because I don't want to be with you anymore.
因为我不想跟你过了

1129
01:23:12,880 --> 01:23:14,160
Understand?
听明白没？

1130
01:23:14,240 --> 01:23:16,360
Enough. I'm done.
够了，不想过了

1131
01:23:45,440 --> 01:23:46,680
Careful...
你慢点…

1132
01:23:47,200 --> 01:23:48,600
Let me hold it for you.
我给你捧着吧

1133
01:23:48,680 --> 01:23:49,880
Look, your suit's all smudged.
你瞅这西服都蹭脏了

1134
01:23:49,960 --> 01:23:51,560
It's fine, it's just work.
没事，干活嘛

1135
01:24:08,080 --> 01:24:09,200
What? Something else?
怎的？ 还有事啊？

1136
01:24:10,160 --> 01:24:11,040
No.
没有了

1137
01:24:11,120 --> 01:24:12,160
I'm heading back.
回去了

1138
01:24:14,560 --> 01:24:15,600
Liru.
丽茹

1139
01:24:17,840 --> 01:24:20,040
Come home tonight, let's have a proper talk.
晚上回家吧，咱好好聊聊

1140
01:24:43,560 --> 01:24:44,600
You're back, Biaozi?
回来了，彪子？

1141
01:24:44,680 --> 01:24:45,760
The jackpot hasn't been drawn yet.
大奖还没出呢

1142
01:24:45,840 --> 01:24:46,840
Buy a couple more tickets.
再来两注吧

1143
01:24:47,360 --> 01:24:48,520
I'm not that lucky.
没那命

1144
01:24:57,840 --> 01:24:58,760
Here.
来

1145
01:25:00,920 --> 01:25:02,080
Eat up, all of you.
都吃饱点

1146
01:25:02,920 --> 01:25:04,360
Full bellies fly far.
吃饱了，飞得远

1147
01:25:17,400 --> 01:25:19,440
Are you ever going to clean up your pigeon droppings?
你家那鸽子屎还能不能收拾了？

1148
01:25:20,440 --> 01:25:21,680
How many times have I said it?
说多少回了都？

1149
01:25:22,240 --> 01:25:23,440
Stinking the place up every single day.
天天整得臭气熏天的

1150
01:25:23,520 --> 01:25:24,960
It's affecting the kids' studies.
都影响孩子学习了

1151
01:25:25,600 --> 01:25:26,800
Stop nagging.
别吵吵了

1152
01:25:27,360 --> 01:25:29,520
Go home and help your kid with homework.
赶紧回家辅导妳孩子学习吧

1153
01:25:30,040 --> 01:25:31,440
I'm cleaning it up, aren't I?
这不收拾吗？

1154
01:25:32,160 --> 01:25:34,080
Soon you won't be able to smell them even if you wanted to.
以后想闻都闻不着了

1155
01:25:34,160 --> 01:25:35,280
Get on with it.
赶紧的吧

1156
01:25:54,480 --> 01:25:55,680
Had enough to eat?
吃饱了吗？

1157
01:26:00,440 --> 01:26:01,720
Full now?
吃饱了吧？

1158
01:26:53,560 --> 01:26:54,560
You're back.
回来了

1159
01:26:57,560 --> 01:26:59,040
Haven't made this in years.
多少年不做了

1160
01:26:59,120 --> 01:27:00,840
Have a taste — is it still the same?
尝尝，还是那味不？

1161
01:27:06,680 --> 01:27:07,720
What is it?
怎么了？

1162
01:27:08,640 --> 01:27:10,320
The way you're looking at me gives me the creeps.
妳看得我直发毛

1163
01:27:15,920 --> 01:27:18,080
Come on, Biaozi, if something's up, just say it.
不是，彪子，你有啥事你就说吧

1164
01:27:18,160 --> 01:27:19,840
Um... they're renovating my shop soon,
那啥…我那店里面一会还装修

1165
01:27:19,920 --> 01:27:21,080
I've got to keep an eye on it.
我得盯着

1166
01:27:23,000 --> 01:27:24,360
In such a hurry?
那么着急啊？

1167
01:27:26,720 --> 01:27:27,960
It's our last meal.
最后一顿饭

1168
01:27:28,640 --> 01:27:30,120
Finish it before you go.
吃完再回去吧

1169
01:27:32,920 --> 01:27:34,120
What do you mean?
啥意思啊？

1170
01:27:36,120 --> 01:27:37,960
I've drawn up a divorce agreement.
我拟了一份离婚协议

1171
01:27:38,040 --> 01:27:39,520
Take a look at it later.
妳回头看一眼

1172
01:27:40,320 --> 01:27:41,720
I've already signed it.
我已经签完字了

1173
01:27:42,320 --> 01:27:43,360
I want nothing.
我啥都不要

1174
01:27:43,880 --> 01:27:45,560
The savings, the house — all yours.
存款、房子都归妳

1175
01:27:46,240 --> 01:27:48,680
As for the pigeons, they're gone even if you wanted them.
那鸽子妳想要也没有了

1176
01:27:48,760 --> 01:27:49,840
I let them all go.
我都放了

1177
01:27:50,720 --> 01:27:52,680
No problem, just sign and it's done.
没啥问题，签个字就完事了

1178
01:28:20,320 --> 01:28:22,360
Have a bowl of soup, it'll get cold.
喝碗汤吧，一会凉了

1179
01:28:22,440 --> 01:28:23,840
All right, I'll serve it.
行了，我盛吧

1180
01:28:23,920 --> 01:28:25,480
You never lift a finger normally.
平时啥都不沾手

1181
01:28:33,280 --> 01:28:36,640
Liru, I've thought it through, really.
丽茹，我想明白了，真的

1182
01:28:37,960 --> 01:28:39,200
All these years,
反正这些年

1183
01:28:39,680 --> 01:28:41,560
you've suffered plenty with me.
妳也跟我遭了不少罪

1184
01:28:43,280 --> 01:28:44,760
Never got to enjoy much.
也没享着啥福

1185
01:28:46,800 --> 01:28:48,520
And I've got nothing to give you.
我也没啥能给妳的

1186
01:28:49,800 --> 01:28:51,720
My life's already turned out this way.
反正我这辈子就这样了

1187
01:28:52,320 --> 01:28:53,720
I just want you to be well.
就希望妳好

1188
01:29:00,680 --> 01:29:02,560
Think you're pretty noble, don't you?
觉得你自己挺伟大吧？

1189
01:29:03,120 --> 01:29:04,520
Naturally.
那必须的

1190
01:29:05,080 --> 01:29:06,640
A '90s college graduate, after all.
90年代大学生嘛

1191
01:29:06,720 --> 01:29:08,160
No good at much else,
别的啥啥不行

1192
01:29:08,240 --> 01:29:10,200
but the refined air, that I've got down.
气质这块必须拿捏呀

1193
01:29:20,920 --> 01:29:23,080
Hurry and eat, it's getting cold.
赶紧吃吧，凉了

1194
01:29:23,160 --> 01:29:24,320
Do me the honor.
给点面子

1195
01:29:36,880 --> 01:29:38,400
When does your shop open?
妳店啥时候开呀？

1196
01:29:39,160 --> 01:29:40,280
By the end of the year.
年底就能开

1197
01:29:41,000 --> 01:29:42,120
What's it called?
叫啥名？

1198
01:29:43,120 --> 01:29:44,440
Haven't decided on a name yet.
名没想好呢

1199
01:29:45,000 --> 01:29:47,000
You're the educated one — think one up for me.
你挺有文化，你帮我想一个吧

1200
01:29:48,160 --> 01:29:49,600
What would I know?
我瞎想啥呀？

1201
01:29:50,240 --> 01:29:51,720
Your partner might not go for it anyway.
妳那合伙人也未必答应

1202
01:29:54,360 --> 01:29:55,280
All right.
行

1203
01:29:55,800 --> 01:29:57,160
I'll say no more.
别的不说了

1204
01:29:58,200 --> 01:30:00,240
Today I'll toast with soup in place of wine.
我今天就以汤代酒了

1205
01:30:00,320 --> 01:30:01,600
I'll drink first, in your honor.
先干为敬

1206
01:30:09,720 --> 01:30:11,640
Don't drink that soup, I made it too salty.
那汤妳别喝了，整咸了

1207
01:30:12,800 --> 01:30:14,080
It'll bother your throat.
弄得嗓子不舒服

1208
01:30:20,280 --> 01:30:21,240
All right.
行

1209
01:30:21,760 --> 01:30:23,480
Anyway, this is settled today.
反正这事今天就定下了

1210
01:30:24,320 --> 01:30:25,320
Liru.
丽茹

1211
01:30:26,600 --> 01:30:27,800
I wish you happiness.
祝妳幸福

1212
01:30:40,480 --> 01:30:42,200
I've left the keys by the door for you.
钥匙我给妳放门口了

1213
01:30:43,960 --> 01:30:45,160
Biaozi.
彪子

1214
01:30:51,240 --> 01:30:53,360
I thought of a name for your shop.
妳那店名我给妳想了一个

1215
01:30:54,800 --> 01:30:56,160
Let's call it "Rumeng" — Like a Dream.
就叫如梦吧

1216
01:30:56,720 --> 01:30:57,840
How's that?
怎么样？

1217
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:01,920
All those years we spent together,
咱俩一起过那么多年

1218
01:31:03,600 --> 01:31:07,160
it always felt like a dream.
老觉得像作一场梦似的

1219
01:31:10,800 --> 01:31:12,400
Now the dream's over.
现在梦醒了

1220
01:31:13,920 --> 01:31:15,480
From now on, let's both be well.
以后咱俩都好好的

1221
01:31:22,160 --> 01:31:23,520
Both be well.
都好好的

1222
01:31:24,960 --> 01:31:26,800
"Rumeng" is a fine name.
就叫如梦挺好

1223
01:31:42,000 --> 01:31:43,400
Life is short.
人生苦短

1224
01:31:43,960 --> 01:31:45,600
Just like Biaozi said,
就像彪子说那样

1225
01:31:46,400 --> 01:31:48,120
life is but a dream.
人生就是一场梦

1226
01:31:49,040 --> 01:31:50,960
I learned a saying recently.
最近学了一句话

1227
01:31:51,560 --> 01:31:54,880
It goes: of life's disappointments,
叫人生不如意的事

1228
01:31:54,960 --> 01:31:56,440
there are eight or nine in ten.
十有八九

1229
01:31:57,120 --> 01:32:00,040
Those you can share your heart with
能说几句心里话的人

1230
01:32:00,120 --> 01:32:01,720
number but two or three.
也就二三

1231
01:32:02,280 --> 01:32:07,080
And as it happens, two bosom friends are right here beside me.
恰好两位知己朋友就在我的身边

1232
01:32:07,160 --> 01:32:08,960
That's enough for one life.
人生足矣

1233
01:32:09,040 --> 01:32:11,320
Come on, brother-in-law, where'd you pick up this talk?
不是，姐夫，你这从哪学的嗑？

1234
01:32:11,400 --> 01:32:13,520
-A whole routine.
-Words from the heart.
-一套一套的
-肺腑之言

1235
01:32:14,200 --> 01:32:15,960
"The Place Where Peach Blossoms Bloom."
《桃花盛开的地方》

1236
01:32:16,040 --> 01:32:17,360
I dedicate it to you.
送给你们

1237
01:32:17,440 --> 01:32:24,440
In that place where the peach blossoms bloom...
在那桃花盛开的地方

1238
01:32:25,800 --> 01:32:28,480
Old Ma... what are you doing?
老马头…干啥呢？

1239
01:32:28,560 --> 01:32:30,760
Um... calling it a night?
那个…收摊了？

1240
01:32:30,840 --> 01:32:32,120
What do you mean, calling it a night?
收啥收摊呀？

1241
01:32:32,640 --> 01:32:34,120
I even brought my insulin.
我胰岛素都带来了

1242
01:32:34,200 --> 01:32:35,280
I came to spend the night with you.
我陪你睡觉来了

1243
01:32:35,360 --> 01:32:36,240
Come on.
来

1244
01:32:36,760 --> 01:32:38,680
Nobody leaves without partying all night, come on.
今天不玩一宿不许走啊，来

1245
01:32:38,760 --> 01:32:40,640
-Aren't you afraid of getting wrecked?
-Thanks.
-这不怕被干废了呀？
-谢谢

1246
01:32:40,720 --> 01:32:42,160
We'll see who ends up wrecked.
谁废还不知道呢

1247
01:32:42,800 --> 01:32:44,400
Xiao Li's still at home waiting for me.
小李还在家等着我呢

1248
01:32:45,400 --> 01:32:46,440
No need to worry about your dog.
你家狗不用操心

1249
01:32:46,520 --> 01:32:48,240
-It was raised on coffee.
-Thanks.
-它喝咖啡长大的
-谢谢

1250
01:32:49,600 --> 01:32:52,040
Homeland...
故乡

1251
01:32:52,120 --> 01:32:55,560
the place that bore me and raised me...
生我、养我的地方

1252
01:32:56,760 --> 01:33:00,160
wherever I stand guard on watch...
无论我在哪里放哨站岗…

1253
01:33:01,680 --> 01:33:02,560
This one's good.
这个好

1254
01:33:03,120 --> 01:33:05,880
My brother-in-law spared no expense today, you know?
我姐夫今天下血本了，知道不？

1255
01:33:06,360 --> 01:33:08,040
I've known this liquor for twenty years.
我认识这酒20年了

1256
01:33:08,520 --> 01:33:10,480
I used to have to call this liquor "grandpa."
以前我得管这酒叫大爷

1257
01:33:10,960 --> 01:33:12,640
Any longer and it'll be my ancestor.
再不喝以后成我祖宗了

1258
01:33:13,200 --> 01:33:14,720
When life gives you joy, drink your fill of it.
人生得意须尽欢

1259
01:33:14,800 --> 01:33:15,800
Never mind ancestor or grandpa,
你别管祖宗、大爷

1260
01:33:15,880 --> 01:33:17,160
you've just got to drink it, right?
你就得整，是不？

1261
01:33:17,240 --> 01:33:18,440
You've got to be happy.
你得高兴

1262
01:33:20,280 --> 01:33:22,760
How many years have we sung this lousy song, brother-in-law?
我说这破歌唱多少年了，姐夫

1263
01:33:23,360 --> 01:33:25,480
Put on something livelier — have Captain Ma dance one.
你点个刺激点的，你让马队跳一个

1264
01:33:25,560 --> 01:33:26,840
-We're all sleepy.
-Okay.
-都困了
-好

1265
01:33:26,920 --> 01:33:31,800
Young man, give us this KTV's most electrifying dance number.
小伙，把本KTV 最刺激的舞曲奉献出来

1266
01:33:31,880 --> 01:33:32,880
You got it.
好咧

1267
01:33:34,720 --> 01:33:35,960
Don't cause any trouble.
别整事啊

1268
01:33:37,640 --> 01:33:40,240
And now, presenting Hualin's Dance King,
下面有请桦林舞王

1269
01:33:40,760 --> 01:33:45,320
Ma-lon De-bran-sheng, taking the stage in dazzling style!
马龙德兰胜闪亮登场

1270
01:33:48,600 --> 01:33:49,880
Not even a dance partner.
也没个舞伴

1271
01:33:50,400 --> 01:33:51,400
So lonely.
好孤独啊

1272
01:33:52,080 --> 01:33:54,040
Hold on, "Hualin Dance King" — why can't I take that lying down?
不是，他桦林舞王 我怎么那么不服呢？

1273
01:33:54,120 --> 01:33:57,040
Back in the disco days, I was somebody at Hualin Tech too.
那当年迪斯科 我也是桦工大有一号啊

1274
01:33:57,120 --> 01:33:59,200
Then everybody, come on.
那就全都来着

1275
01:33:59,280 --> 01:34:00,120
Come on.
来

1276
01:34:39,480 --> 01:34:40,840
Here, keep drinking.
来，接着喝

1277
01:34:43,160 --> 01:34:44,160
Here, Captain Ma.
来，马队

1278
01:34:45,280 --> 01:34:46,200
Captain Ma.
马队

1279
01:34:46,760 --> 01:34:47,680
Come on.
来

1280
01:34:49,120 --> 01:34:50,240
No more for me.
不喝了

1281
01:34:50,920 --> 01:34:52,000
I'm going home.
回家

1282
01:34:52,920 --> 01:34:54,280
Old Ma, you're no fun.
老马头，你这没意思了

1283
01:34:54,880 --> 01:34:55,760
Where's your stamina?
啥体力呀？

1284
01:34:55,840 --> 01:34:57,240
Always talking yourself up.
还总给我拉硬的

1285
01:34:58,920 --> 01:35:00,280
I'm getting old.
我老了

1286
01:35:16,440 --> 01:35:18,240
How did we ever get through this life of ours?
你说咱这辈子怎么过来的？

1287
01:35:20,040 --> 01:35:21,920
Sometimes I try to recall something,
有时候总想回忆点啥

1288
01:35:22,880 --> 01:35:25,880
I rack my brain, and I can't remember a thing.
寻思半天，啥也记不起来了

1289
01:35:29,720 --> 01:35:30,720
Biaozi.
彪子

1290
01:35:32,680 --> 01:35:34,440
Not remembering is a good thing.
记不住是好事

1291
01:35:37,360 --> 01:35:38,520
Some things,
有些事

1292
01:35:39,480 --> 01:35:41,480
what should be remembered, we remember.
该记着咱就记着

1293
01:35:42,400 --> 01:35:44,520
What should be forgotten, we absolutely forget.
该忘了绝对要忘

1294
01:35:45,720 --> 01:35:47,080
Right, Captain Ma?
对不对，马队？

1295
01:35:47,160 --> 01:35:48,440
What's this?
怎么的？

1296
01:35:49,640 --> 01:35:51,440
Are we really splitting up for good this time?
这回真散伙了？

1297
01:35:52,960 --> 01:35:54,000
Splitting up.
散伙

1298
01:35:54,840 --> 01:35:56,760
Each to his own home, each to his own mother.
各回各家，各找各妈

1299
01:35:57,880 --> 01:36:03,920
I sincerely thank you two good brothers for all your care and effort these past days.
老哥对二位贤弟 这些日子的费心费力表示衷心的感谢

1300
01:36:04,000 --> 01:36:05,800
Come on, drink.
来，喝酒

1301
01:36:05,880 --> 01:36:07,720
I don't like hearing you talk like that.
我不爱听你说这话

1302
01:36:08,920 --> 01:36:10,640
There are things I can't forget.
有些事我忘不了

1303
01:36:11,800 --> 01:36:13,520
This isn't your burden alone.
这不是你一个人的事

1304
01:36:16,160 --> 01:36:18,880
I'll see this through to the end, for sure.
这事我肯定整到底

1305
01:36:18,960 --> 01:36:20,560
That animal...
那畜生啊…

1306
01:36:29,600 --> 01:36:30,640
Biaozi.
彪子

1307
01:36:32,280 --> 01:36:34,200
When I was young,
我年轻的时候

1308
01:36:35,160 --> 01:36:37,080
I sure as hell didn't believe in fate.
特他妈不信命

1309
01:36:38,840 --> 01:36:41,520
The older I get, the more I see I was wrong.
我越老越发现我错了

1310
01:36:43,320 --> 01:36:46,480
Our fates were all set in stone.
咱这命都给定下来了

1311
01:36:51,320 --> 01:36:52,680
Who arranged it?
谁安排的？

1312
01:36:55,280 --> 01:36:57,440
Are we just meant to have the fate we've got?
咱这命就活该就这命吧？

1313
01:37:00,040 --> 01:37:01,400
Why can't I accept it?
我怎么不服呢？

1314
01:37:02,160 --> 01:37:04,080
Bring him here, I'll have a good talk with him.
你叫他过来，我跟他好好唠唠

1315
01:37:09,280 --> 01:37:10,600
If I could find him,
我要是能找着他

1316
01:37:10,680 --> 01:37:12,400
I'd fight him to the death.
我肯定跟他玩命

1317
01:37:17,040 --> 01:37:18,360
Listen to me, brother-in-law.
听我的吧，姐夫

1318
01:37:18,440 --> 01:37:19,920
If we're going to live, let's live happily.
活咱就活得乐呵的

1319
01:37:20,000 --> 01:37:21,480
We'll deal with it when we find him.
啥时候找着他再说

1320
01:37:26,640 --> 01:37:27,800
Here, brother-in-law.
来，姐夫

1321
01:37:27,880 --> 01:37:29,240
-Drink.
-Drink.
-喝
-喝

1322
01:37:29,920 --> 01:37:31,360
-Drink up.
-Drink.
-喝呀
-喝

1323
01:38:00,920 --> 01:38:03,120
Brother-in-law... are you two awake?
姐夫…你俩醒没有？

1324
01:38:03,600 --> 01:38:05,000
Get up, pull yourselves together.
赶紧起来精神精神

1325
01:38:05,480 --> 01:38:07,520
A real man can bend and rise again.
大丈夫能屈能伸

1326
01:38:07,600 --> 01:38:09,080
Get up, it's a new day.
起来又是新的一天

1327
01:38:10,280 --> 01:38:12,200
Bought you breakfast, wait for me to get back.
给你买早点了，等我回来

1328
01:38:17,680 --> 01:38:19,120
Sir, are you extending the room?
老哥，您这还续不？

1329
01:38:19,200 --> 01:38:21,240
It's the end of our shift, we've got to clock off.
这我们到点了，得下班了

1330
01:38:21,320 --> 01:38:22,480
No, we're done...
不续了…

1331
01:38:22,560 --> 01:38:25,320
-Okay, settle the bill?
-The bill...
-好，那买单？
-买单…

1332
01:38:25,400 --> 01:38:26,240
Pack these up...
打个包…

1333
01:38:26,320 --> 01:38:28,120
-Sure thing.
-Pack them separately.
-好咧，成
-分着放

1334
01:38:28,200 --> 01:38:29,280
-Okay.
-Okay...
-好，行
-好…

1335
01:38:30,520 --> 01:38:31,360
Captain Ma.
马队

1336
01:38:31,440 --> 01:38:32,360
Captain Ma.
马队

1337
01:38:32,880 --> 01:38:33,880
Wake up.
起来了

1338
01:38:34,520 --> 01:38:35,560
It's morning.
早晨了

1339
01:38:36,280 --> 01:38:37,680
Go home and sleep, Captain Ma.
回家睡去，马队

1340
01:38:37,760 --> 01:38:38,600
Captain Ma.
马队

1341
01:38:40,240 --> 01:38:44,120
What's a little pain in the wind and rain...
风雨中这点痛算什么

1342
01:38:44,200 --> 01:38:46,480
Wipe your tears, don't be afraid...
擦干泪，不要怕

1343
01:38:46,560 --> 01:38:49,040
At least we still have dreams...
至少我们还有梦

1344
01:38:50,560 --> 01:38:53,400
The results of Sports Lottery draw No. 16129.
体育彩票第16129期的开奖结果

1345
01:38:54,040 --> 01:38:56,080
Friends who missed yesterday's live drawing,
错过了昨天开奖直播的朋友

1346
01:38:56,160 --> 01:38:57,960
why not take out your ticket
不妨拿出您手中的彩票

1347
01:38:58,040 --> 01:39:00,040
and see if this draw's lucky jackpot winner
看看本期大奖的幸运得主

1348
01:39:00,120 --> 01:39:02,120
might just be you, there by your radio?
会不会是收音机前的您呢？

1349
01:39:02,840 --> 01:39:03,680
All right.
好了

1350
01:39:03,760 --> 01:39:06,240
This draw's winning numbers for the front zone of the Grand Lotto
本期大乐透前区开出的中奖号码

1351
01:39:06,320 --> 01:39:08,440
are: 07,
分别是07

1352
01:39:09,280 --> 01:39:11,840
-08, 19...
-Damn.
-08、19
-我去

1353
01:39:12,400 --> 01:39:15,040
30, 35.
30、35

1354
01:39:16,080 --> 01:39:22,800
07, 08, 19, 30, 35.
07、08、19、30、35

1355
01:39:23,360 --> 01:39:25,480
Now let's look at the winning numbers for the back zone.
现在我们来看后区开出的中奖号码

1356
01:39:26,040 --> 01:39:27,800
The first number is 08...
第一个数字是08…

1357
01:42:07,640 --> 01:42:08,720
Feeling better?
好点没？

1358
01:42:12,840 --> 01:42:13,960
What are you doing?
干啥呢？

1359
01:42:14,560 --> 01:42:15,920
Practicing holding your breath?
练闭气呢？

1360
01:42:33,280 --> 01:42:35,320
I didn't cancel the banquet.
那酒席我没退啊

1361
01:42:36,480 --> 01:42:38,960
Let's pick a good day and get married.
咱俩找个正日子把婚结了吧

1362
01:42:40,840 --> 01:42:42,080
Go.
你走吧

1363
01:42:47,480 --> 01:42:48,560
What?
啥玩意？

1364
01:42:49,160 --> 01:42:50,240
What did you say?
妳說啥呀？

1365
01:42:50,320 --> 01:42:51,840
Go.
你走吧

1366
01:42:52,440 --> 01:42:53,760
I lied to you.
我骗你了

1367
01:42:56,160 --> 01:42:58,880
What? Having second thoughts?
不是，怎么的？ 反悔了？

1368
01:42:59,440 --> 01:43:01,040
Don't want to marry me anymore?
不想嫁我了？

1369
01:43:03,480 --> 01:43:05,360
You look down on me.
你嫌弃我吧

1370
01:43:05,840 --> 01:43:08,600
I lied to you.
我骗你了

1371
01:43:18,240 --> 01:43:20,360
Don't bring it up, it's all in the past.
别提了，都翻篇了

1372
01:43:28,360 --> 01:43:29,680
From now on, I...
我以后…

1373
01:43:32,840 --> 01:43:35,240
I probably can't have children anymore.
可能不能再生孩子了

1374
01:43:38,520 --> 01:43:40,280
Then I want you all the more.
那我更得要妳了

1375
01:43:40,360 --> 01:43:42,360
No kids, then we'll raise something else.
没孩子就养点别的吧

1376
01:43:46,040 --> 01:43:47,360
You really want me?
你真要我？

1377
01:43:48,000 --> 01:43:49,560
Why would I lie to you?
骗妳干啥呀？

1378
01:43:49,640 --> 01:43:51,160
I even brought you flowers.
我花我都带来了

1379
01:43:55,080 --> 01:43:56,960
Your favorite calla lilies.
妳最喜欢的马蹄莲

1380
01:43:59,440 --> 01:44:01,000
You picked my flowers again.
你又薅我花了

1381
01:44:03,080 --> 01:44:04,480
This time I bought them.
这次是买的

1382
01:44:12,120 --> 01:44:13,640
Biaozi.
彪子

1383
01:44:21,680 --> 01:44:22,840
No more crying now.
不哭了
